<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/11th-galaxy-workshop-on-hts-data-analysis> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description """Educators:\r
Freiburg Galaxy Team\r
\r
Date:\r
June 17 - 21, 2024\r
\r
Location:\r
Uni Freiburg\r
\r
Contents:\r
1-week full-day hands-on workshop in Freiburg.\r
\r
Topics:\r
- Galaxy Introduction\r
- Data analysis of RNA-seq, ATAC-seq, \r
\r
Learning goals:\r
- To get introduced to Galaxy as data analysis platform and the GTN training material\r
- To learn how to use use tools and databases in Galaxy\r
- To be able to run different tools and workflows\r
\r
Topics:\r
- Quality control\r
- Mapping\r
- Differential expression analysis\r
- Workflow design\r
- Statistics\r
- Visualization.\r
\r
Prerequisites:\r
No. Beginner training course!\r
\r
Keywords:\r
Galaxy, NGS, HTS,  RNA-seq, ChIP-seq, Exome-seq, MethylC-seq\r
\r
Tools:\r
Galaxy""" ;
