        [ a schema1:Audience ;
            schema1:audienceType "Researchers" ],
        [ a schema1:Audience ;
            schema1:audienceType "Infrastructure providers" ] ;
    schema1:description """The FAIR Digital Objects Forum will run the 1st International Conference on FAIR Digital Objects (FDO2022) on 26-28 October in Leiden, The Netherlands. The Conference will bring together for the first time at this scale key technical, scientific, industry, and science‐policy stakeholders with the aim to boost the development and implementation of FDOs worldwide. \r
FDO2022 will conclude with the formal signing and publication of the Leiden Declaration on FAIR Digital Objects.""" ;
