        "Configure your Galaxy to use these reference genomes and indices",
        "Create a tutorial from scratch",
        "Create hands-on",
        "Create several charts",
        "Deal with the dependencies",
        "Deploy a Beacon",
        "Extract a list of tools from a workflow",
