<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/3rd-biohackathon-germany> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description """PROJECT APPLICATION: Q2 2024\r
\r
REGISTRATION: Q3 2024\r
\r
CODE OF CONDUCT\r
The ELIXIR Germany Code of Conduct has been created so all participants at ELIXIR Germany events organized can interact with each other in a respectful and safe environment, and have avenues to turn to in case they believe there has been a breach to this Code of Conduct.\r
\r
HOTELS IN KASSEL\r
La Strada\r
\r
as well as others available via common booking platforms\r
Travel information:\r
\r
Our venue for the BioHackathon Germany 2024 - Hotel La Strada - is located in the middle Germany.\r
\r
Via Plain:\r
\r
- To Frankfurt or Hanover Airport\r
\r
Via Train:\r
\r
- To Station Kassel/Wilhelmshöhe\r
- Tram lines 1, 2, 3 or 4 in the direction of the city centre\r
- Get off at "Rathaus" station\r
- Change to tram line 5 in the direction of Baunatal, line 6 in the direction of Brückenhof or line 9 in the direction of Mattenberg\r
- Get off at "Park Schönfeld" station\r
\r
Via Car:\r
\r
- Via A49 direction city centre\r
- Exit at Kassel Auestadion\r
- Turn left at the 3rd traffic light onto Frankfurter Strasse (out of town)\r
- Turn left at the next set of traffic lights into Raiffeisenstrasse\r
- After approx. 200m you will find your destination on the right-hand side\r
\r
More Information will follow!""" ;
