    schema1:description "4ADD workshop/hackathon (21.1.-25.1.2019) is focused on the use of in silico drug design tools and approaches in the drug design and optimimization. We will cover both structure-based drug design (molecular docking, molecular dynamics, structural bioinformatics tools) and ligand-based drug design (QSAR, pharmacophores, deep learning). Hackathon on the last day is the best opportunity to try your skills on our ligand selection challenge." ;
