    schema1:description "5ADD workshop/challenge (3.2.-7.2.2020) is focused on the use of in silico drug design tools and approaches in drug design. We will cover both structure-based drug design (molecular docking, molecular dynamics, structural bioinformatics tools) and ligand-based drug design (QSAR, pharmacophores, deep learning) with lectures and on-hand tutorials. Last day you can try your skills on the ligand selection challenge." ;
