<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/6th-biodata-pt-elixir-pt-technical-meeting> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:description """## Join the BioData.pt | ELIXIR-PT Technical Meeting: Collaborate, Innovate, Advance\r
\r
Are you ready to tackle pressing challenges in research data management and foster innovative solutions? The BioData.pt | ELIXIR-PT Technical Meeting is your chance to join a multidisciplinary forum dedicated to addressing the needs of the life and health sciences community through collaboration, knowledge-sharing, and cutting-edge tools.\r
\r
### What is the Technical Meeting About?\r
\r
This meeting is designed to bring together researchers, bioinformaticians, data stewards, and community leaders to:\r
\r
- Identify technical challenges faced by research communities and platforms.\r
- Collaborate in interactive working groups to design practical solutions, improve data interoperability, and streamline research workflows.\r
- Explore new tools and services to enhance data management and collaboration.\r
\r
### Why Participate?\r
\r
- Gain practical insights into addressing community-specific challenges.\r
- Network with experts and peers to develop synergies across disciplines.\r
- Contribute to shaping solutions that advance research data management in Portugal and beyond.\r
\r
### Your Contribution Matters\r
\r
Participants are encouraged to share their challenges and expertise, helping to co-design actionable solutions for real-world problems. Together, we will improve tools, harmonize data workflows, and foster collaboration.""" ;
    schema1:endDate "2025-03-25 21:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
    schema1:location [ a schema1:Place ;
