        [ a schema1:Audience ;
            schema1:audienceType "Life Science Researchers" ] ;
    schema1:description """The 7ADD workshop/challenge (January 29, 2024 – February 2, 2024) focuses on utilising in silico tools and approaches in drug design. We cover both structure-based drug design (molecular docking, molecular dynamics, and structural bioinformatics tools) and ligand-based drug design (QSAR, pharmacophores, and deep learning) with lectures and hands-on tutorials. \r
\r
Dedicated YouTube playlist at https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z5cwZhVW64E&amp;list=PLRGiGr8c-LlJhMBKt0LqcUSjaMIJnET5W""" ;
