    schema1:description "The Job Dispatcher at EMBL-EBI provides free access to a variety of bioinformatics tools and biological datasets via web and programmatic interfaces. This webinar will provide a comprehensive guide on navigating various sequence analysis tools (EMBOSS, Clustal Omega, NCBI BLAST+, etc.) and showcase the newest updates to the website. It will also demonstrate how to access these tools programmatically." ;
