    schema1:description """Educators:\r
Isabel Schober, Joaquim Sardà, Lorenz Reimer (BioData)\r
\r
Date:\r
24 November 2025, 15:00-17:00 CET\r
\r
Location:\r
Online\r
\r
Contents:\r
This workshop will give a short introduction to the new BacDive website and a first look at the soon-to-be-introduced genome browser. Participants will have the opportunity to ask questions, give feedback, and provide ideas. We look forward to discussing BacDive with you!\r
\r
Registration is not required. Email training@bacdive.de to receive the log in information. \r
\r
Learning goals:\r
- Efficiently use BacDive and provide ideas for its further development\r
\r
Prerequisites:\r
None\r
\r
Keywords:\r
Databases, Bioinformatics, Bacteria, Genomes, Sequences\r
\r
Tools:\r
BacDive""" ;
