    schema1:description "The purpose of this workshop is to gain knowledge on detect (foodborne) pathogens from (direct Nanopore) sequencing data using Galaxy. The workshop will be on October 14th 2024 as a 1-day F2F at FHNW Muttenz, Switzerland, free and practical workshop." ;
