    schema1:description """The purpose of this workshop is to seek input on training needs for the technical operators of biomedical science research infrastructures. This will help to ensure that CORBEL’s training plans meet the needs of technical operators in your research infrastructure, especially with regards to data management, user access, ethical, legal and social implications, and innovation.\r
