    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description """Educators:\r
Marius Dieckmann (BiGi), EMBL-EBI Cloud consultants\r
\r
Date:\r
09.02.2021\r
10:00 - 18:00\r
\r
Location:\r
Online\r
\r
Contents:\r
- Kubernetes\r
- Service-Mesh\r
- advanced Deployments\r
\r
Learning goals:\r
- Deeper understanding of Kubernetes Deployments\r
- Using Service-Meshes for deployments/debugging/introspection and securing communication\r
\r
Prerequisites:\r
Knowledge in Kubernetes and Docker; Basic skills in software engineering. A sandbox(VM) will be provided by the organisers, your laptop/machine should have ssh client to connect sandbox. This is not an introductory course\r
\r
Keywords:\r
Kubernetes, Software-Engineering, DevOps\r
\r
Tools:\r
Kubernetes, Docker""" ;
