    schema1:alternateName "This 4-day workshop provides a thorough overview of single-cell data analysis, aimed at researchers planning a single-cell project." ;
    schema1:contact "training@earlham.ac.uk" ;
    schema1:description """Save the date! Registration opens in May 2023. \r
\r
Register your interest to be notified of developments.\r
\r
This 4-day workshop provides a thorough overview of single-cell data analysis, aimed at researchers planning a single-cell project. The course will consist of a mixture of conceptual and methodological lectures and hands-on bioinformatics sessions. \r
\r
Please be advised that this is a redevelopment of a previous course, and the final programme is to be confirmed. We are also exploring whether to host in person or virtually, please contact training@earlham.ac.uk if you would like to advise preference.\r
\r
For an overview, please visit our 2022 Single-Cell RNAseq Data Analysis page.  """ ;
