    schema1:description "This webinar series illustrates concepts, resources, and recent advancements in spatial omics, covering topics such as spatial transcriptomics, cell-cell communication, spatial metabolomics, and infrastructure development for spatial omics experiments. The webinars making up this series are listed below. Follow the links to find out more about each webinar. You will need to register for each webinar you would like to attend. Recordings will be made openly available of all webinars on their individual pages." ;
