<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/ai-for-science-communication> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description "Do you want to optimize AI writing assistants (like ChatGPT) to suit your writing needs?Do you feel you spend too much time fixing generic AI output instead of just starting fresh? In this hands-on workshop, you will learn how to use the right prompts to make AI work FOR you. Through examples and exercises, you will learn how to improve your writing skills and productivity using AI text generators like ChatGPT." ;
