    schema1:contact "Melissa Burke" ;
    schema1:description "WormBase ParaSite provides genome sequence, genome browsers, semi-automatic annotation and comparative genomics data for approximately one hundred species plus a number of other tools. This webinar provides parasite researchers with an introduction to the website and shows you how to use key tools." ;
