<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/analysis-of-16s-rrna-metagenomic-experiments> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:description """Processing and statistical analysis of 16S rRNA metagenomic experiments using R &amp; Lotus pipeline. The following analytical steps from raw data to communicable results will be on the programme:\r
\r
- Preparation of sequencing data, read filtering, data cleaning\r
\r
- Data normalization\r
\r
- Numerical ecology: Clustering, Ordination, Diversity, Modelling\r
\r
- Univariate &amp; Multivariate Statistics\r
\r
- Biological interpretation""" ;
