    schema1:description """GENEVESTIGATOR® enables analysis of deeply curated bulk tissue and single-cell transcriptomic data from public repositories with user-friendly visualization tools. The unique collection of high quality data can be queried for biomarker and target discovery, diagnostics and in silico modelling. 

Access to Genevestigator is free for VIB scientists. """ ;
