    schema1:description "Are you coding regularly? Do you want to assure quality of your code and learn about the version control software git? Git keeps records of all changes that you make in your scripts, facilitates collaborative development, and most importantly, allows you to revert to previous states when you did something wrong. This absolute beginner’s training course on git teaches you the basics to get started and assure high-quality of your code!" ;
