<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/basic-statistics-theory-a1675f95-b0d2-4e66-9266-163c08300f5f> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description "The training is an introduction to the use of statistics for basic analyses of life sciences data. People who want to follow: 'Basic statistics in R' or 'Basic statistics in Prism' and who have no statistics background are advised to follow this training first. The R and Prism trainings show how to do statistics in R or Prism but not why we choose a certain test, make a certain plot…. Those who want to know more about the why should follow this training on our e-learning platform." ;
