    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description """The training is available on YouTube: https://youtu.be/Zd9FkB348zk  

The training will be replaced by an online questions and answers session on May 12th. 
Please watch the youtube video and send questions to Janick.Mathys@vib.be before May 11th.
Please register for this training if you want to be contacted with details about the questions and answers session.
For those who want to follow a live face-to-face training: these will not be organized before September. 

______________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

This training gives an introduction to the use of statistics for basic analyses of life sciences data. 
