<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/biigle4beginners-december-workshop> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description """Educators:\r
Tim W. Nattkemper, Martin Zurowietz (BiGi)\r
\r
Date:\r
December 5th, 2024 (14:00-16:00 CET)\r
\r
Location:\r
Online\r
\r
Contents:\r
The workshop targets an international audience wanting to get started with the BIIGLE image and video annotation software (https://biigle.de). In the workshop, we will show you what BIIGLE is and teach you a basic end-to-end annotation workflow.\r
\r
Learning goals:\r
After the workshop you should be able to start your own image and video annotation projects in BIIGLE. You should also feel confident to explore the more advanced features of BIIGLE.\r
\r
Prerequisites:\r
Participants will join remotely using their personal computers (mobile phones and tablets are not suitable). We will use the conferencing solution Zoom and work with BIIGLE in a web browser.\r
\r
Keywords:\r
image annotation, video annotation\r
\r
Tools:\r
BIIGLE, web browser""" ;
    schema1:hasCourseInstance [ a schema1:CourseInstance ;
            dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/CourseInstance/1.0-RELEASE> ;
