The BioHackathon offers an intense week of hacking, with over 160 international participants who work on diverse and exciting projects. This year there will be 37 hacking projects.\r
\r
For details of this year's event see the BioHackathon website. To find out what happened in previous BioHackathons, see the BioHackathon Europe page.""" ;
