<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/biosb-2020-dutch-bioinformatics-systems-biology-conference> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:description """The 6th edition of the Dutch Bioinformatics &amp; Systems Biology conference will be organised on April 21 and 22, 2020 at the congrescentrum De Werelt in Lunteren. This year's conference will be co-organised by the BioSB research school and the Utrecht Bioinformatics Center.\r
\r
The BioSB 2020 conference discusses the latest developments in bioinformatics, systems and computational biology and interrelated disciplines, and their wide-ranging applications in life sciences &amp; health, agriculture, food &amp; nutrition. \r
\r
The conference will feature keynote lectures, parallel sessions featuring selected, highlight and invited talks, breakout sessions, poster &amp; demo sessions, network breaks and a conference dinner and social event. \r
\r
The conference will also offer a track organised by ELIXIR Netherlands.""" ;
