    schema1:description "The [Light Imaging Facility](https://www.embl.org/groups/light-imaging-facility/) (LIF) at [EMBL Rome](https://www.embl.org/sites/rome/) offers training and support to users for experimental design, tissue sample processing, imaging data acquisition, and image analysis. Importantly, the LIF is also involved in technology development, ensuring access to innovative sample and imaging techniques such as spatial transcriptomics and expansion microscopy. This webinar will demonstrate how we built a service platform for spatial transcriptomics using our in-house developed methods." ;
    schema1:hasCourseInstance [ a schema1:CourseInstance ;
