    schema1:alternateName "Summer Edition" ;
    schema1:audience [ a schema1:Audience ;
            schema1:audienceType "Life Science Researchers" ] ;
    schema1:coursePrerequisites """Background knowledge of NGS data formats and the first steps in the analysis\r
workflow (fastqc -> bam files). If you are a newbie in the field, you have to follow\r
the NGS introduction training first. Experience in R programming is highly recommended.\r
If you never worked with R, you should attend the R introduction training\r
first.""" ;
    schema1:description """The course consists of introductory online material (e-learning) on counting and two face-to-face sessions on differential expression analysis in R and all the questions that arise when trying the analysis on your own data.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------""" ;
