Tue (Sep 12) , 11:30 - 12:30 	On-boarding for team leaders leading groups over video\r
Tue (Sep 12) , 13:00 - 14:00 	On-boarding for team leaders leading in-person teams\r
Tue (Sep 12) , 14:30 - 16:00 	Installation help for everybody\r
	 \r
Installation help and on-boarding (you don't need to attend both days, choose the day that is better for you)\r
Wed (Sep 13) , 11:30 - 12:30 	On-boarding for team leaders leading groups over video\r
Wed (Sep 13) , 13:00 - 14:00 	On-boarding for team leaders leading in-person teams\r
Wed (Sep 13) , 14:30 - 16:00 	Installation help for everybody\r
	 \r
