Tue (Sep 19) , 09:00 - 09:20 	Welcome and introduction (TBA)\r
Tue (Sep 19) , 09:20 - 11:00 	Introduction to version control - part 1/4 (TBA)\r
Tue (Sep 19) , 12:00 - 13:30 	Introduction to version control - part 2/4 (TBA)\r
	 \r
