	 \r
Day 3\r
Thu (Sep 21) , 09:00 - 11:00 	Collaborative distributed version control - part 1/2 (TBA)\r
Thu (Sep 21) , 12:00 - 13:30 	Collaborative distributed version control - part 2/2 (TBA)\r
	 \r
Day 4\r
