<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/communication-expectation-management-for-support-staff> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description """Topics that will be addressed during this training are:

Professional communication: touch base


	Communication Types &amp; Styles
	What’s your communication ‘style’?
	Do’s &amp; don’ts in professional communication


Expectation management: The impact of asking questions


	What is expectation management
	Keystones in good customer communication
	Client requirements vs. Expectations
	Realigning customer expectations:
	Recognizing the signs of diverging expectations
	Re-managing customer expectations


Setting boundaries in your project management


	Feature creep: How to Handle changing client requirements and limiting excessive questions.
	What is the professional and customer benefit in a clear project scope.
	Handling objections
	How to set boundaries and handle negotiations""" ;
    schema1:hasCourseInstance [ a schema1:CourseInstance ;
            dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/CourseInstance/1.0-RELEASE> ;
            schema1:courseMode "onsite" ;
            schema1:endDate "2023-09-05 17:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
