<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/communication-skills-establishing-connective-clarity-38a7c2dc-9688-4a93-a2a0-b53d1ce2e57a> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description """Due to the Corona crisis, this training will be offered in an online live format  on 13 &amp; 27 May. More information will be sent to the participants after registration.




 

The general aim of effective communication is creating visibility for your messages. This is often felt to be a challenge, in communication in hierarchical contexts as well as in conversations amongst peers. Giving yourself the mandate to create this visibility, feeling yourself able to do it, and daring to actually start such conversations are core elements in communicating with impact. """ ;
