""" ;
    schema1:description "The Data Stewardship Wizard (DSW) is a web browser tool for creating and customising data management plans (DMPs) and associated templates. DMPs can be exported following recommendations from national and international funders including the Norwegian Research Council. This workshop applies to all data-driven fields." ;
