    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description "This one-day workshop is aimed at helping people understand the workflow from data acquisition and processing to analysis and scripting. We strongly encourage all current AxioScan users to attend. If anyone has an image that would be of interest for a demonstrations, please contact the organizers at the lasted 10 days prior to the workshop." ;
