DataverseNO ([https://dataverse.no/](https://dataverse.no/)) is a national, generic repository for open research data, owned and operated by UiT The Arctic University of Norway. DataverseNO is aligned with the FAIR Guiding Principles for scientific data management and stewardship. The technical infrastructure of the repository is based on the open source application Dataverse, developed by an international developer and user community led by Harvard University. DataverseNO is CoreTrustSeal certified.

