<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/data-interoperability-joint-platform-f2f-hybrid-meeting> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:description """\r
	Event Information\r
\r
	 \r
\r
	The ELIXIR Data and Interoperability Platforms will be hosting a joint hybrid face-to-face meeting in Geneva, Switzerland this year. The event follows on after last year's successful event in Padova, Italy which similarly was run in a hybrid format. This meeting will focus on the respective internal Platform project plans, Core Data Resources (CDR), Recommended Interoperability Resources (RIR) and beyond this to the Platform synergies and overlaps. Exact content will be detailed in the event agenda programme and linked closer to the event date.\r
\r
	Day 1 - Data Platform Focus - 28th November\r
		Day 2 - Data &amp; Interoperability Focus - 29th November \r
		Day 3 - Interoperability Platform Focus - 30th November \r
\r
\r
Venue: \r
	Campus de Battelle, Building B,\r
	Address: Rue de la Tambourine 17, CH - 1227 Carouge\r
\r
Travel : Map\r
\r
By public transport:\r
\r
Tram ligne nº 12 et nº 18 : bus stop "Carouge"\r
	Bus n° 44 et 45, bus stop "Grange-Collomb"\r
	Horaires en ligne www.tpg.ch\r
\r
More information can be found here\r
\r
Accommodation: Recommended hotels \r
\r
Auberge Communale hotel (single room from 160 CHF)\r
	Ibis Styles Geneve Carouge (single room from 160 CHF)\r
\r
 \r
\r
 """ ;
