\r
0900 - 0915 Introduction\r
\r
0915 - 0930 Requirements from the RCN\r
\r
0930 - 1015 Parallel session\r
\r
	Local recommendations and storage infrastructures \r
\r
	Institutional DMP guidelines\r
\r
1015 - 1030 Short break\r
\r
1030 - 1100 Introduction DSW\r
\r
