<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/data-management-plans-double-course> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description """Day 1: "Introduction to Data Management Plans" is an introductory course aimed at disseminating Data Management best practices and teaching the basics of making and using Data Management Plans (DMPs) in the context of research activities. It features two introductory lectures, respectively on Research Data Management and DMPs, followed by a hands-on DMP exercise where participants will form groups to fill in a DMP for a mock research project, using Google Spreadsheets. The produced DMPs will then be reviewed and discussed.

 

Day 2: "Advanced Data Management Plans" is a follow-up course aimed at empowering participants to make their own real Data Management Plan according to the Science Europe DMP Template (adopted by FCT) on an online platform. It features three lectures covering advanced concepts in data management, the Science Europe DMP Template, and Data Stewardship Wizard (the DMP creation tool that participants will use), followed by a hands-on session where participants create their DMP, either alone or in pairs, with assistance from the teachers. Participants are encouraged to bring their own research projects to be the object of their DMP.

 

Both courses will be delivered online, in real time, via Zoom.

 

TARGET AUDIENCE

Researchers, Lab Managers, PhD and Master Students, other science professionals.

No prior knowledge required for day 1.

Basic knowledge of data management or participation in day 1 expected for day 2.

Maximum number of participants: 20 

 

TRAINERS

João Cardoso (BioData.pt/INESC-ID)

Daniel Faria (BioData.pt/INESC-ID)

 

AGENDA

Day 1

10:00 Check-in

10:05 Introduction to Research Data Management (Daniel Faria)

11:15 Break

11:30 Demystifying Data Management Plans (João Cardoso)

11:55 Introduction to the Hands-On DMP Exercise (João Cardoso &amp; Daniel Faria)

12:10 Hands-On DMP Session (steps 1 and 2)

13:30 Lunch break

14:30 Hands-On DMP Session (steps 3, 4 and 5)

16:30 Final discussion

17:00 End

 

Day 2

10:00 Check-in

10:05 The Science Europe DMP Template (João Cardoso)

10:25 Advanced Data Management Topics (Daniel Faria)

11:00 The Data Stewardship Wizard (João Cardoso)

11:15 Break

11:45 Hands-On DMP Creation Exercise (Part 1)

13:30 Lunch break

14:30 Hands-On DMP Creation Exercise (Part 2)

17:00 End

 

Date: 6 Outubro - 7 October 2021""" ;
    schema1:hasCourseInstance [ a schema1:CourseInstance ;
            dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/CourseInstance/1.0-RELEASE> ;
