    schema1:description """Data Processing in R for advanced users co- organized with Janet Gardner from EEG.

This will be a 6 hours workshop on 15/11 9:30 - 12:30 - lunch break - 1:00pm - 4:00pm covering the same subjects as workshop #2 but will be much more focused on writing code (programming in R) and practical exercises and will skip the basics.

To sign up please email marcin.adamski@anu.edu.au no later than October 7th. The workshops are offered at no cost.

""" ;
