<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/day-2-day-data-management-course-cebal> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description "This course covers diverse topics such as FAIR Principles and Open Science best practices, Data Management Plans, metadata standards and ontologies, an overview of online data management resources, and practical exercises related to data documentation using an Electronic Laboratory Notebook and data sharing using DataVerse. It aims to provide tools and improve the efficiency of data management throughout the Data Life Cycle, in order to help researchers with the day-to-day data management aspects of research activities." ;
