    schema1:description "The main purpose of this workshop is to provide a good overview of biomarkers and biomarker studies. This workshop will explore recent research, showcasing diverse biomarker applications within clinical trials. Methods employed to identify biomarkers through various omics datasets will be reviewed. Participants will engage in discussion on biomarker studies and data analysis exercises that encompass approaches like machine learning methods and other integrative omics strategies used in biomarker discovery." ;
