<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/elixir-aai-online-advanced-training-for-relying-services> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:audience [ a schema1:Audience ;
            schema1:audienceType "Developers" ] ;
    schema1:description """The target group of the training is developers and administrators of services that want to integrate with some advanced functionality of the ELIXIR AAI for user authentication and authorisation. The free remote training consists of a two and half hour webinar followed by homework that the participants are advised to do afterwards. The training will focus on \r
\r
- non-web authentication support by ELIXIR AAI (based on OAuth2 device code flow  and \r
\r
- provisioning and deprovisioning of user accounts and authorization data from ELIXIR AAI to the end services.  \r
\r
As the homework, the participants will set up non-web authentication using the ELIXIR AAI to the remote machines provided by the trainers.""" ;
