<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/elixir-aai-training-for-relying-services> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:about <http://edamontology.org/topic_3316> ;
    schema1:audience [ a schema1:Audience ;
            schema1:audienceType "software developers, bioinformaticians" ] ;
    schema1:description """The target group of the training is developers and administrators of services that want to integrate with the ELIXIR AAI for user authentication and authorisation. \r
\r
The training consists of a one hour webinar followed by homework that the participants are advised to do afterwards. As the homework, the participants can integrate a test service (provided by the trainers in a VM) or their own service to the test environment of ELIXIR AAI.\r
\r
Presentations and an archived stream is available in the training homepage.""" ;
