<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/elixir-aai-training-for-service-providers> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description """The ELIXIR AAI training helps new services to integrate to ELIXIR AAI, the ELIXIR Compute Platform service portfolio for authenticating researchers and helping the relying services to decide what they have permission to do in the service. The target group of the training are developers and administrators of services that want to integrate to ELIXIR AAI for user authentication and authorisation. The training has hands-on sessions for the participants to integrate their own service (or, a test service provided by the trainers) to ELIXIR AAI.\r
\r
The event is sponsored by EXCELERATE project and co-located with a CORBEL AAI training.\r
\r
Register to the event using your ELIXIR ID (if you don't have one you can get it here).""" ;
