    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:alternateName "NGS Data Analysis and Machine Learning Applications" ;
    schema1:contact """Fotis E. Psomopoulos (fpsom@certh.gr)\r
Celia van Gelder (celia.van.gelder@dtls.nl)""" ;
    schema1:description """As part of the [CODATA-RDA Research Data Science Summer School](http://indico.ictp.it/event/8706/) in Trieste, ELIXIR Training has contributed in the organization of the flanking Advanced Bioinformatics workshop (19-23 Aug 2019) with a particular focus on Machine Learning applications and workflows.\r
\r
This advanced bioinformatics course provided an overview of the current status of different NGS workflows (variant calling, RNA-Seq, etc), and combined them with the appropriate Machine Learning and Data Mining approaches. After providing a strong foundation of the underlying theory and concepts, the course relied heavily on hand-on exercises and tutorials in order for the participants to directly apply and practice on methods and techniques  presented throughout each day.\r
\r
The course was led by [Fotis E. Psomopoulos](https://fpsom.github.io/) (INAB-CERTH) from  ELIXIR Greece, with [Amel Ghouila](https://github.com/amelgh) ([H3ABionet](https://www.h3abionet.org)) and [Phelelani Mpangase]([H3ABionet](https://www.h3abionet.org)) as co-instructors of the course. Moreover, the daily training activities were supported by Maria Tsagiopoulou (INAB|CERTH) as a helper.""" ;
    schema1:endDate "2019-08-23 17:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
    schema1:location [ a schema1:Place ;
            schema1:address [ a schema1:PostalAddress ;
                    schema1:addressCountry "Italy" ;
                    schema1:addressLocality "Grignano" ;
                    schema1:addressRegion "Provincia di Trieste" ;
                    schema1:streetAddress """Adriatico Guest House - Denardo Lecture Hall\r
International Centre for Theoretical Physics\r
Trieste, Italy""" ] ;
            schema1:latitude "45.707174" ;
            schema1:longitude "13.714402" ] ;
    schema1:maximumAttendeeCapacity 30 ;
    schema1:name "ELIXIR / CODATA-RDA Research Data Science Advanced Workshop on Bioinformatics" ;
    schema1:startDate "2019-08-19 09:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
    schema1:url <https://codata-rda-advanced-bioinformatics-2019.readthedocs.io/en/latest/_downloads/1d93f6f74b5b3075ae2759026ffc122e/AdvancedBioinformaticsCourseMLProgramme.pdf> .

