<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/elixir-compute-platform-2022-face-to-face-meeting> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:description """We are pleased to now invite you to register for the forthcoming ELIXIR Compute Platform face-to-face event in Berlin (DE), taking place from Monday 25 April (12.00-17.00 CET including lunch) to Tuesday 26 April 2022 (09.00-16.00 CET) at the Hotel Berlin, Berlin, kindly hosted by the ELIXIR Germany Node.\r
\r
Registration for online live stream\r
\r
The event will be live streamed and Zoom details provided upon successful regsitration via confirmation mail. Regsitration will remain open until the day of event. Register here!\r
\r
(Face-to-face registration is now closed for in person attendance in Berlin) \r
\r
Accommodation\r
\r
The accommodation is on hold at the venue where the meeting takes place (Hotel Berlin Berlin). The discounted meeting price is 109 EUR / per night in the single room including breakfast. The agreed prices include the respective statutory value added tax any other taxes and charges (e.g. tourist tax, bed tax, city tax) are charged extra.\r
\r
The booking has to be done via dedicated hotel link. Please select the dates, add the promotion code “ELIXIR Compute 22”. The reservation of the rooms can only be made by providing full credit card details to guarantee the booking. Guests will pay all services by themselves upon departure.\r
\r
Agenda\r
\r
This year’s focus will be to reconnect and meet new Platform members as well as reflecting on Platform activities in recent years and looking ahead to the 2024+ Programme and live topics such as EOSC, AAI Migration and Service Sustainability. Please find a link to the agenda upon successful registration.""" ;
    schema1:endDate "2022-04-26 16:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
    schema1:location [ a schema1:Place ;
            schema1:address [ a schema1:PostalAddress ;
                    schema1:addressCountry "Germany" ;
                    schema1:addressLocality "Berlin" ;
                    schema1:postalCode "10785" ;
                    schema1:streetAddress "Hotel Berlin" ] ] ;
    schema1:name "ELIXIR Compute Platform 2022 Face-to-Face Meeting" ;
    schema1:startDate "2022-04-25 12:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
    schema1:url <https://www.elixir-europe.org/events/compute-2022-f2f> .

<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/elixir-compute-platform-2023-face-to-face-meeting> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:description """We are pleased to invite you to register for the forthcoming ELIXIR Compute Platform face-to-face event in Helsinki, Finland. \r
\r
Day 1: Tuesday 7 February, 2023 from 10:00-17:00 EET (including lunch)\r
\r
Day 2: Wednesday 8 February, 2023 from 09:00-14.00 EET \r
\r
Venue and accomodation\r
\r
Hotel Katajanokka, Helsinki in Helsinki, Finland.\r
\r
Event accomodation booking link can be found here.\r
\r
Evening Meal - Day 1 (7th February)\r
\r
ELIXIR-FI and CSC as the local hosts are kindly providing the evening meal on Day 1 of the event. The restaurant location and meal time will be included in the agenda. \r
\r
Agenda\r
\r
This year’s focus of the Compute Platform will be centred around planning for the 2024-2028 ELIXIR Programme. Please find a link to the agenda upon successful registration.""" ;
