<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/elixir-cz-info-days-2019-27ae3538-b43e-4a62-b8e7-043115fc5631> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:description """ELIXIR CZ the infrastructure for biological data has been launched in 2015 as a part of the pan European research infrastructure ELIXIR. Since this time ELIXIR CZ provide access to tools and training to facilitate an activities such as storing, processing and analysing life science data.\r
The increasing volume of data in life science is a challenge.\r
- How do we handle such amount of data?\r
- How do we make them Findable, Accessible, Interoperable and Reusable so we can do users life easier?\r
- Which services do we offer?\r
These and other questions will be answered. Come to ELIXIR CZ INFO Day and get useful information for your work.""" ;
    schema1:eligibility "first_come_first_served" ;
    schema1:endDate "2019-11-18 12:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
