<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/elixir-data-platform-edp-face-to-face-kick-off-meeting> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:description """ELIXIR Data Platform (EDP) Kick Off meeting\r
	Tue 15 - Wed 16 October 2019, Hinxton\r
\r
Members of the ELIXIR Data Platform will gather in person to plan the details of the four Tasks of the EDP work programme for 2019-2021.\r
\r
These are:\r
\r
\r
	Administration and support for Core Data Resource (CDR) and ELIXIR Deposition Database (EDD) portfolio\r
	Literature-Data Integration\r
	Scalable Curation\r
	Long Term Sustainability.\r
\r
\r
The Venue is South Building, EMBL-EBI, Wellcome Genome Campus, South Building, Hinxton, Cambridgeshire CB10 1SD\r
\r
Travel and Accommodation\r
\r
A limited number of rooms are being held at the: \r
\r
Wellcome Genome Campus Conference Centre Accommodation (on campus).\r
\r
Delegates are responsible for booking their accommodation. We recommend booking early in order to avoid disappointment.\r
\r
 \r
\r
Alternative accommodation is:\r
\r
Red Lion, Hinxton (short walk to campus)\r
\r
Holiday Inn Express, Whittlesford (bus available to campus)\r
\r
Crown Hotel, Great Chesterford (bus available to campus)\r
\r
Contacts\r
\r
For any agenda enquires, please contact Rachel Drysdale. \r
\r
For any logistical enquires, please contact Melissa Balzano.""" ;
    schema1:endDate "2019-10-16 13:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
    schema1:name "ELIXIR Data Platform (EDP) Face-to-Face Kick Off Meeting" ;
    schema1:startDate "2019-10-15 12:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
    schema1:url <https://www.elixir-europe.org/events/elixir-data-platform-edp-face-face-kick-meeting> .

<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/elixir-data-platform-f2f-2024> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:description """We are pleased to invite you to join for the forthcoming ELIXIR Data Platform face-to-face event in Padova, Italy.\r
\r
Day 1: Tuesday 1 October 2024, 09:00-17:00 CEST  \r
\r
Day 2: Wednesday 2 October 2024, 09:00-13:00 CEST\r
\r
Venue and accomodation\r
\r
The event will take place at the Hotel NH Padova in Padova, Italy.\r
\r
For those requiring accommodation, we recommend attendees stay at the same hotel as the event, but this is not strictly required. Availability of funding for travel depends on individual Node policy and priority, please contact your Node coordinator for information. \r
\r
For event rate bookings on the nights 30th September &amp; 1st October email mtngs.nhpadova@nh-hotels.com or nhpadova@nh-hotels.com including the reference number MB0003970805. After the reservation any cancellation is a penalty of 100%. The event rate is only available until 22nd June.\r
\r
-Event rate, single room: €169.00 \r
\r
-Event rate, double room: €189.00\r
\r
After this date, room bookings should be made directly, either on the venue website or via the usual hotel platforms.\r
\r
Travel logistics\r
\r
Information for reccomended travel routes to Padova can be found here.\r
\r
Online attendance\r
\r
All plenary and meeting sessions will be fully hybrid using the Zoom platform with conference cameras and microphones. Registration for virtual only attendance will be possible via the same registration link. \r
\r
Agenda\r
\r
Full agenda available upon registration.\r
\r
Registration deadlines\r
\r
\r
	In person:  17 September 2024\r
	Online:  27 September 2024\r
\r
\r
ELIXIR-STEERS: WP2 &amp; WP3 event\r
\r
Subsequent to the ELIXIR Data Platform event, a 1.5 day event from the ELIXIR-STEERS EC project will take place at the same venue. This WP2+3 focused STEERS event will take place after the Data Platform event and is independent:\r
\r
Day 1: Wednesday 2nd October, 2024 from 13:00-17:00 CEST  \r
\r
Day 2: Thursday 3rd October, 2024 from 09:00-17.00 CEST  \r
\r
Registration note: a single Eventscase registration is in place for both events and attendees will be able to register for one or both of the events. Therefore, you will not have to register twice if attending both events.""" ;
    schema1:endDate "2024-10-02 13:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
    schema1:location [ a schema1:Place ;
            schema1:address [ a schema1:PostalAddress ;
                    schema1:addressCountry "Italy" ;
                    schema1:addressLocality "Padova" ;
                    schema1:addressRegion "PD" ;
