<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/elixir-emerging-microbiome-marine-metagenomics-community-f2f-hybrid-meeting> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:description """The ELIXIR emerging Microbiome/Marine Metagenomics Community F2F/hybrid meeting takes place from Tuesday 12 September 2023, 12:00 CEST to Wednesday 13 September 2023, 16:00 CEST. This meeting is planned as a hybrid meeting, with the F2F component in Barcelona and the final session will be joined with the ELIXIR Biodiversity Community.\r
\r
During the meeting Community members will come together to discuss topics related to the Community and shape plans going ahead with regards to the Microbiome focus and possibilities of Implementation Studies upcoming during the 2024-2028 ELIXIR Scientific Programme. \r
\r
The meeting will include presentations, workshops and participant engagement - see the agenda. Don’t hesitate to get in touch if you want to contribute or have any questions. \r
\r
This meeting has a limit of in-person attendees, with no-limit on virtual participant numbers. Selected invited participants will receive funding to attend the meeting. Details regarding funding and reimbursement will be shared after registration. Please do not book any travel till after you have been notified.\r
\r
Travel and venue\r
\r
The meeting will be hosted at Barcelona Science Parc (Parc Científic de Barcelona, more information will be shared closer in time). \r
\r
Once notified of your F2F attendance you will be expected to make your own travel and accommodation arrangements to the venue, reimbursement information will be shared with invited attendees after their successful registration.\r
\r
Recommended accommodation (please consider shared reimbursement rules)\r
\r
\r
	NH Barcelona Stadium\r
	Barcelona Arenas Atiram\r
	Atenea Barcelona Aparthotel\r
	Hotel Alguer Camp Nou\r
\r
\r
Registration deadline \r
\r
\r
	For F2F attendance: Thursday 17 August 2023\r
	For virtual attendance: Monday 11 September 2023\r
\r
\r
Contacts: Katharina Heil (katharina.heil@elixir-europe.org) and Physilia Chua (physilia.chua@elixir-europe.org)""" ;
    schema1:endDate "2023-09-13 16:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
    schema1:location [ a schema1:Place ;
            schema1:address [ a schema1:PostalAddress ;
                    schema1:addressCountry "Spain" ] ;
            schema1:latitude "39.326069" ;
            schema1:longitude "-4.837979" ] ;
    schema1:name "ELIXIR Emerging Microbiome/Marine Metagenomics Community F2F/hybrid meeting" ;
    schema1:startDate "2023-09-12 12:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
