    schema1:description """The ELIXIR Galaxy Community meeting takes place from 12:00 CEST on Wednesday 4 October to 13:00 CEST on Thursday 5 October.  The Community F2F meeting is integrated into the European Galaxy Days, making a Galaxy event of three full days.\r
\r
More information, including registration instructions, can be found on the Galaxy Europe website. \r
\r
The meeting is largely hybrid and will include presentations, workshops and participant engagement. \r
\r
Additional Registration information\r
\r
Please note, if you have selected to attend face to face, this option is limited. ELIXIR will offer limited funding to a number of F2F attendees to visit the event (commonly for one night). If you are eligible to receive funding, you will be informed about reimbursement details as soon as possible. \r
\r
Additional general information\r
\r
Can be found on the Galaxy Europe Days website - linked above.\r
\r
Contact: manthos.pitoulias@elixir-europe.org and katharina.heil@elixir-europe.org.\r
\r
See also: Galaxy Community\r
\r
Registration deadline: F2F: 18 September 2023; virtual: 3 October 2023""" ;
