<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/elixir-interoperability-platform-f2f-meeting-hybrid-2024> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:description """Event\r
    Overview\r
Join us for a dynamic and interactive meeting of the\r
    ELIXIR Interoperability Platform. Platform members will meet to consolidate the great progress made this year and look to define the direction of the next one. All ELIXIR members are welcome to register. \r
Dates and Venue\r
\r
    Dates: 25-26\r
        November 2024\r
    Venue: Leonardo Hotel Manchester Central, Manchester, UK\r
\r
Meeting Schedule\r
\r
    Day\r
            1: Monday 25 November 2024 12:00–18:00\r
        GMT\r
    Day 2: Tuesday 26 November 2024\r
        09:00–14:00 GMT\r
\r
Accommodation\r
We recommend attendees stay at the Leonardo Hotel Manchester Central, where the event will take place. Please note that there are two Leonardo Hotels in Manchester.\r
\r
The hotel can be booked directly via their website using the Promo Code EVENT20 in the search bar. \r
\r
Online Attendance\r
All plenary and\r
    meeting sessions will be fully hybrid, utilizing the Zoom platform with\r
    conference cameras and microphones. Registration for virtual-only\r
    attendance is available via the same registration\r
    link.\r
Registration Deadlines\r
\r
    In\r
            Person: 11 November\r
        2024\r
    Online: 18 November\r
        2024\r
\r
Agenda\r
The agenda will be included in the email confirming registration. It is subject to change.\r
Contact Information\r
For\r
    any inquiries, please contact fabio.liberante@elixir-europe.org.\r
We look forward to your participation and seeing you in Manchester.""" ;
    schema1:endDate "2024-11-26 14:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
