                    schema1:addressCountry "United Kingdom" ;
                    schema1:addressLocality "Manchester" ;
                    schema1:postalCode "M1 5LE" ;
                    schema1:streetAddress "Leonardo Hotel Manchester Central, 56 Great Bridgewater St" ] ;
            schema1:latitude "53.479489" ;
            schema1:longitude "-2.245115" ] ;
    schema1:name "ELIXIR Interoperability Platform F2F Meeting (Hybrid) 2024" ;
    schema1:startDate "2024-11-25 12:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
    schema1:url <https://www.elixir-europe.org/events/elixir-interoperability-platform-f2f-meeting-hybrid-2024> .

<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/elixir-interoperability-platform-face-to-face-eip-f2f-meeting> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:description """Aim\r
\r
At this EIP F2F meeting, we will focus on setting out strategic roadmap of activities for 2019-2023 by mapping the EIP key activities and services to the the ELIXIR Communities’ use cases and cross-platform interactions. Discussion of the development of specific implementations of tools and services will follow the strategy roadmap at this meeting. We encourage participation both from within the the EIP community, and outside (other platforms, and use case communities), and both strategy leadership and engineering development levels. Key participant groups for each session are noted, but all sessions are open to all audience.\r
\r
Expected Outcomes\r
\r
Input for digestion by Interoperability platform to generate an action plan for EIP 2019-2023 key activities mapped to prioritised use cases and cross-platform activities. Materials derived from the discussion will identify highlights to be included in the presentation at the EIP workshop at the ELIXIR All-hands Meeting (17th-20th June 2019, Lisbon), along with key challenges identified during this EIP F2F meeting.\r
\r
Timings and date\r
\r
Day 1: 1 April 12:00 - 17:30\r
\r
Day 2: 2 April 08:45 - 14:00\r
\r
Venue\r
\r
Full details on how to reach the Novotel Hotel, please visit their website. Delegate are responsible for making their own accommodation and travel arrangement. \r
\r
Contacts\r
\r
For all agenda inquiries, please contact: Sirarat Sarntivijai (sirarat.sarntivijai@elixir-europe.org)\r
	Tel: +44 (0)1223 494214\r
\r
For all logistical inquiries, please contact: Melissa Balzano (melissa.balzano@elixir-europe.org) \r
	Tel: +44 (0)1223 494305""" ;
