<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/elixir-sparkle-impact-green-workshop> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:description """We, at BioData.pt | ELIXIR Portugal, are preparing an impact assessment and environmental sustainability workshop, scheduled to take place **online** on **Monday, September 30th**. This workshop is in collaboration with ELIXIR Hub and the Italian and Norwegian ELIXIR Nodes.  
  
Workshop Topics:

- Assessing the impact of research activities;
- Learning how impact assessment is conducted in research infrastructures;
- Greening Research (Operations, computing, etc);
- Understanding ELIXIR's initiatives on environmental sustainability;

This workshop is an excellent opportunity for professionals interested in these areas to gain insights and network with peers from various life science research infrastructures.""" ;
    schema1:endDate "2024-09-30 15:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
    schema1:name "ELIXIR-SPARKLE Impact & Green Workshop" ;
    schema1:startDate "2024-09-30 08:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
    schema1:url <https://biodata.pt/events/elixir-sparkle-impact-green-workshop> .

<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/elixir-steers-wp2-3-workshop> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:description """We are pleased to invite you to join for the forthcoming STEERS WP2+3 event in Padova, Italy.\r
\r
Day 1: Wednesday 2 October 2024, 13:00-17:00 CEST  \r
\r
Day 2: Thursday 3 October 2024, 09:00-17:00 CEST\r
\r
 \r
\r
Venue and accomodation\r
\r
The event will take place at the Hotel NH Padova in Padova, Italy.\r
\r
For those requiring accommodation, we recommend attendees stay at the same hotel as the event, but this is not strictly required. Room bookings should be made directly, either on the venue website or via the usual hotel platforms. Availability of funding for travel depends on individual Node policy and priority, please contact your Node coordinator for information. \r
\r
For event rate bookings on the nights 2nd &amp; 3rd October email mtngs.nhpadova@nh-hotels.com or nhpadova@nh-hotels.com including the reference number MB0003977708. After the reservation any cancellation is a penalty of 100%.\r
\r
-Event rate, single room: €169.00 \r
\r
-Event rate, double room: €189.00\r
\r
Attendance funding\r
\r
Please note that this is an ELIXIR-STEERS project meeting. ELIXIR-STEERS partners should use their project budget to cover travel and accommodation (in line with their institutional rules on travel and subsistence costs). Those not funded by the project should note that availability of funding for travel depends on individual ELIXIR Node policy and priority, please contact your Node coordinator for information.\r
\r
Travel logistics\r
\r
Information for reccomended travel routes to Padova can be found here.\r
\r
 \r
\r
Online attendance\r
\r
All plenary and meeting sessions will be fully hybrid using the Zoom platform with conference cameras and microphones. Registration for virtual only attendance will be possible via the same registration link. \r
\r
 \r
\r
Agenda\r
\r
Full agenda available upon registration.\r
\r
Registration deadlines\r
\r
\r
	In person:  17 September 2024\r
	Online:  27 September 2024\r
\r
\r
 \r
\r
ELIXIR Data Platform 2024 event\r
\r
Prior to the ELIXIR STEERS WP2+3 workshop event, a 1.5 day event from the ELIXIR Data Platform will take place at the same venue. This ELIXIR Data Platform event will take place before the ELIXIR STEERS WP2+3 workshop event and is independent:\r
\r
Day 1: Tuesday 1st October, 2024 from 09:00-17:00 CEST  \r
\r
Day 2: Wednesday 2nd October, 2024 from 09:00-13.00 CEST  \r
\r
Registration note: a single Eventscase registration is in place for both events and attendees will be able to register for one or both of the events. Therefore, you will not have to register twice if attending both events.\r
\r
 """ ;
