<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/elixir-training-platform-f2f-hybrid-meeting> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:description """The ELIXIR Training Platform meeting is confirmed to take place from Tuesday, 7 March, 12:00 CET, to Thursday, 9 March, 14:00 CET in Casa dell'Aviatore, Viale dell’Università, 20, 00185, Rome, Italy. This meeting is planned as a hybrid meeting. \r
\r
The Training Platform, including all of ELIXIR’s Training Coordinators will meet to share updates and jointly work on open Training related aspects and ELIXIR Training Platform tasks.\r
\r
This year is particularly important in light of the 2024-2028 Scientific Programme Developments\r
\r
The meeting will include presentations covering both past and future activities and participant engagement.\r
\r
Please see the Preliminary Programme\r
\r
Date\r
\r
Tuesday 7 March, 12:00 CET, to Thursday 9 March\r
\r
\r
	Day 1 - Tuesday7 March 2023, 12:00 - 18:00 CET Training Platform meeting\r
	Day 2 - Wednesday 8 March 2023, 09:00 - 18:00 CET Training Platform  meeting\r
	Day 3 - Thursday 9 March 2023, 09:00 - 14:00 CET Training Platform meeting\r
\r
\r
Accommodation\r
\r
There is the option to stay at the venue (subject to availability). Approximate price range: from 80 Euro to 120 Euro (including breakfast). Please email manthos.pitoulias@elixir-europe.org if interested, no later than Thursday February 9th 2023.\r
\r
Alternatively please make your own accommodation arrangements as there are plenty of hotel choices in the area.\r
\r
Contact\r
\r
Manthos Pitoulias manthos.pitoulias@elixir-europe.org\r
\r
Katharina Heil katharina.heil@elixir-europe.org""" ;
