<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/elixir-trcg-tecg-f2f-meeting> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:description "This year the Technical Coordinators Group (TeCG) and the Training Coordinators Group (TrCG) will have their annual face to face meeting together in a joint meeting in Paris. The objective of the coordinators groups is to facilitate knowledge exchange, identify issues and opportunities and provide advice to HoNs. This meeting will include node updates, platform updates and a retrospective and discussion of future plans. The joint meeting will include a topic discussion centred on an update on how metrics are used in ELIXIR and a discussion about how they can be used to evaluate the success/impact of ELIXIR as an infrastructure." ;
