			Help &amp; About\r
		\r
	\r
\r
\r
This is part of a series of webinars with the IDB Community, all recordings are available on the ELIXIR Youtube channel or through these links: \r
\r
\r
	An introduction to DisProt \r
	Exploring structural and functional annotations of IDPs with DisProt\r
""" ;
    schema1:endDate "2022-09-07 14:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
