    schema1:description """This internal webinar is primarily intended for data resource managers submitting a database to the third round of ELIXIR Core Data Resource and Deposition Database selection, however anyone with an interest is most welcome to join.  The webinar will cover criteria for selection of the ELIXIR Core Data Resource and Deposition Databases, and the application and review processes.\r
\r
Registration is required!""" ;
