            schema1:audienceType "This workshop is aimed at researchers who need to undertake sequence searching as part of their work. Those who are graduate students, postdocs and staff members from the University of Cambridge, affiliated institutions and other external Institutions or individuals, are invited to apply.&nbsp;No previous bioinformatics experience is required, but an undergraduate level understanding of biology would be an advantage." ] ;
