    schema1:contact "Robi Tacutu" ;
    schema1:description """In this course participants will explore EMBL-EBI resources for genomics and sequence alignments. The sessions focus on sequence similarity searching and alignments as well as accessing, retrieving genomic data for a variety of organisms from Ensembl/Ensembl genome browser.\r
