    schema1:description """eTRIKS and ELIXIR-Luxembourg Node organize a data preprocessing and curation training that will cover the necessary steps to clean, reformat and upload data to a data integration platform "tranSMART".\r
\r
The training will be divided in the following sections:\r
1) Basic introduction of tranSMART (i2b2 tree and database)\r
2) Format of standard-format-file that are needed by the ETL scripts\r
3) How to setup the data loading environment\r
4) How to use the ETL scripts\r
5) Hand-on sessions of 2) 3) and 4)\r
""" ;
