    schema1:description """This one and a half day workshop will provide detailed training on the utilisation of the wealth of data generated by the [EuroFAANG GENE-SWitCH project](https://www.gene-switch.eu/) that is delivering new underpinning knowledge for pig and chicken agriculture. The workshop will primarily focus on the comprehensive and integrated annotation of the chicken and pig genomes by the [Ensembl Genome Browser](www.ensembl.org). The course will also include a deeper dive from the Ensembl analysis teams into gene annotation and regulation, and demonstrations of the specific analyses and genomic prediction models generated by GENE-SWitCH researchers.

 """ ;
