<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/excelerate-train-the-trainer-in-clinical-bioinformatics-and-best-practices-workshop> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description """An ELIXIR EXCELERATE Train-the-Trainer in Clinical bioinformatics and HEE best practices workshop will be held in Cambridge UK, 3-5 July 2017.\r
\r
The aim of the course is to provide new trainers with guidance and tips for developing and delivering training in bioinformatics to clinical audiences. \r
\r
This will be followed by a best practices workshop, providing an opportunity for people already involved in this kind of training, or in the process of developing it, to come together and exchange best practice/experiences.\r
\r
More details can be found in the Google doc.\r
\r
Participants will be selected based on their expertise. To apply, fill in this form by 28 April.  Participants will be notified by 5 May.""" ;
    schema1:hasCourseInstance [ a schema1:CourseInstance ;
            dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/CourseInstance/1.0-RELEASE> ;
