<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/exploring-non-coding-rnas-in-rnacentral-9dff0b53-8ae8-48ce-9278-0184323752b6> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:about <http://edamontology.org/format_1213>,
        <http://edamontology.org/topic_0659> ;
    schema1:description """RNAcentral is a database of non-coding RNA sequences that provides a unified view of \\&gt;40 specialised databases. This webinar will give an overview of the data found in RNAcentral as well as the RNAcentral website.

The team will share tips on how to efficiently explore the data using text and sequence similarity search, how to visualise RNA secondary structure, and how to access the bulk data in the FTP archive. More advanced functionality, including the programmatic data access and public Postgres database, will also be discussed.

Join the webinar to also learn what's new in RNAcentral or ask any questions you may have.""" ;
    schema1:hasCourseInstance [ a schema1:CourseInstance ;
            dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/CourseInstance/1.0-RELEASE> ;
