    schema1:description """The [Ensembl Plants genome browser](https://plants.ensembl.org/index.html) provides visualisation and analysis of integrated genomic data, including genes, variants, comparative genomics and gene regulation, for over 100 plant species and cultivars. This webinar will provide an overview of the range of available data and through Ensembl Plants and use examples to explore the various interfaces for visualising and exporting data.

