        <http://edamontology.org/topic_3892> ;
    schema1:description "This webinar will give an overview of [BioModels](https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biomodels/), a popular repository of curated systems biology models. This will include a recent update on model content and features. It will also briefly introduce BioModels Parameters, a sub-resource within BioModels that provides model parts. It will show how modellers can easily find, access and reuse, interoperable systems biology models.  We will also discuss how curation efforts in BioModels tackle the reproducibility crisis." ;
