<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/fairdom-user-meeting> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:description """The next FAIRDOM user meeting is scheduled for 17th of October, 2022 at 14:00 CEST.\r
\r
The purpose of the FAIRDOM user meetings is to establish an active FAIRDOM user community to allow networking between various FAIRDOM-SEEK users and learn from each other’s experiences. Within the two-hours event invited users will showcase the use of FAIRDOMHub and other FAIRDOM-SEEK instances for their research projects. After the presentations we’ll have plenty of time for discussions and networking.\r
\r
Speakers:\r
•	Huiming Ding (Massachusetts Institute of Technology, US): “Creating mutable samples using NExtSEEK”\r
•	Sara El-Gebali (SciLifeLab Data Centre, SE): “Samples Metadata at the SciLifeLab”\r
•	Marek Ostaszewski (Luxembourg Centre for Systems Biomedicine, LU): “FAIRDOMHub - a platform for the research community building the COVID-19 Disease Map”\r
""" ;
    schema1:eligibility "registration_of_interest" ;
    schema1:endDate "2022-10-17 16:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
    schema1:event_types "meetings_and_conferences" ;
    schema1:keywords "FAIRDOM",
        "data management" ;
    schema1:name "FAIRDOM User Meeting" ;
    schema1:organizer [ a schema1:Organization ;
            schema1:name "FAIRDOM (https://fair-dom.org)" ] ;
    schema1:startDate "2022-10-17 14:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
    schema1:url <https://fair-dom.org/events/2022-10-17-FAIRDOM-user%20meeting> .

