<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/fellowship-of-the-data-meeting-2025> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:description """Fellowship of the Data Meeting 2025!\r
\r
01.-02. April 2025\r
\r
Rosensäle, University of Jena\r
\r
Registration is now open!\r
\r
See the agenda, the fantastic speakers and sessions as well as the registration possibilities here:\r
https://www.denbi.de/de-nbi-events/1751-fellowship-of-the-data-meeting-2025\r
\r
Fellowship of the Data - Agenda, Partners, and Registration\r
\r
The Fellowship of the Data event aims at connecting RDM enthusiastic communities with interesting presentations, engaging session discussions, and plenty of networking opportunities!\r
\r
Event’s topics tackle the RDM landscape in Germany and beyond, jobs in RDM, diversity of RDM tasks, data competency initiatives and centers, digital note taking, and change management with a focus on:\r
\r
Data Steward* Newbie Jumpstart: Overview of Landscape, Stakeholders, Support &amp; Networks\r
\r
The Life of a Data Steward*: Tips &amp; Tricks, Fails, Task Diversity\r
\r
Changing Research Data Management Culture: What, Why, How?\r
\r
* Data Steward = RDM professional, trainer, data manager, curator, and all similar roles promoting research data management for scientists of any field and discipline from all nations.\r
\r
Target Audience:\r
\r
We invite everyone interested or involved in RDM:\r
\r
Data Stewards/Manger/Curators, Researchers, Trainers, RDM professionals, RDM Officers, or all other titles the community encompasses. If you are interested in working in RDM, you are more than welcome to join the meeting! All disciplines welcome!\r
\r
Looking forward seeing you all in person! Be a DataFellow!""" ;
