<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/galaxy-training-network-day-online-cofest-and-community-call> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description """Educators:\r
Bérénice Batut (RBC)\r
\r
Date:\r
September 12th 2019\r
\r
Location:\r
Online\r
\r
Contents:\r
The Galaxy Training Network is organizing every 3 months one day dedicated to the training community: collaborative work on the training content but also calls with the community. The next day will be on the 12th of September. Anyone who would like to contribute, learn how to contribute to the Galaxy Training Material or just catch up with the community is very welcome to join. During the day, we will have 2 GTN community calls to share news about Galaxy and Training, and also just chat together. To accommodate different time zones and schedules, there will be 2 calls (with similar discussions) at 8am (UTC + 2) and 4pm (UTC + 2) via Hangout. Outside of these calls, we will have a CoFest (Collaboration Fest). We will coordinate via Hangout (drop-in channel we will keep open the whole day) and the GTN Gitter channel.\r
\r
Learning goals:\r
- Establishment of new Galaxy Training Material\r
- Improvement of current Training Material\r
\r
Prerequisites:\r
Interest in Training\r
\r
Keywords:\r
Galaxy, Training\r
\r
Tools:\r
Galaxy""" ;
    schema1:hasCourseInstance [ a schema1:CourseInstance ;
            dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/CourseInstance/1.0-RELEASE> ;
            schema1:courseMode "online" ;
            schema1:endDate "2019-09-12 17:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
            schema1:organizer [ a schema1:Organization ;
                    schema1:name "de.NBI / GTN" ] ;
            schema1:startDate "2019-09-12 09:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ] ;
    schema1:name "Galaxy Training Network day: (online) CoFest and community call " ;
    schema1:provider [ a schema1:Organization ;
            schema1:name "ELIXIR Germany" ;
            schema1:url <file:///home/runner/work/ELIXIR-TrP-KG-training-metadata/ELIXIR-TrP-KG-training-metadata/> ],
        [ a schema1:Organization ;
            schema1:name "GTN" ;
            schema1:url <https://training.galaxyproject.org/> ] ;
    schema1:url <https://www.denbi.de/training/667-galaxy-training-network-day-online-cofest-and-community-call> .

<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/galaxy-training-using-galaxy-for-rna-seq> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:description """This practical aims to familiarize you with the Galaxy user interface &amp; execute a complete analysis of RNA-seq data.\r
\r
It will teach you how to perform basic tasks such as importing data, running tools, working with histories, creating workflows, and sharing your work. In this tutorial we will introduce you to bare basics of Galaxy:\r
\r
\r
	Getting data from external databases such as UCSC\r
	Performing simple data manipulation\r
	Understanding Galaxy’s History system\r
	Creating and running a workflow\r
\r
\r
The RNA-seq data analysis part comprises:\r
\r
\r
	Filtering and quality control of reads\r
	Mapping of reads to reference genomes\r
	Examples of downstream data-analysis possibilities (variant calling, differential expression, etc.) \r
\r
\r
This workshop is organised by ELIXIR Belgium.""" ;
    schema1:endDate "2019-10-08 00:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
    schema1:location [ a schema1:Place ;
