<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/gatersleben-research-conference-19th-international-symposium-on-integrative-bioinformatics> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:contact """Lisa Schlehuber\r
Leibniz Institute Plant Genetics and Crop Plant Research (IPK)\r
Correnstrasse 3\r
D-06466 Stadt Seeland, OT Gatersleben\r
+49 (0)39482 5-837\r
\r
GRC-IB2025@ipk-gatersleben.de""" ;
    schema1:description """Join us for the **Gatersleben Research Conference Series**, an annual gathering of leading minds in plant research and life sciences. This year, from **September 10–12, 2025**, we are excited to host the **„International Symposium on Integrative Bioinformatics“** at the Leibniz Institute of Plant Genetics and Crop Plant Research (IPK) in Gatersleben. [Read more about IPK!](https://meetings.ipk-gatersleben.de/grc-ib2025/venue-2/).\r
\r
This esteemed symposium serves as a dynamic platform for bioinformaticians, computer scientists, life science researchers, and interdisciplinary professionals to explore the latest advancements and applications in integrative bioinformatics. Engage in thought-provoking discussions, share groundbreaking research, and network with international experts. \r
\r
We invite researchers at all career stages to submit abstracts for oral or poster presentations at GRC-IB2025. This symposium provides an excellent opportunity to present original work and engage with an international network of experts in integrative bioinformatics, plant science, and computational biology.""" ;
    schema1:eligibility "first_come_first_served" ;
    schema1:endDate "2025-09-12 14:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
    schema1:funder [ a schema1:Organization ;
            schema1:name "Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft (Project Number: 566171779)" ],
        [ a schema1:Organization ;
            schema1:name "de.NBI" ] ;
