    schema1:description "In this course we will develop a geometric deep learning model that takes a protein structure as input and predicts binding site residues. Through the process, we will cover the basics of data processing, tracking performance, hyperparameter configuration, training and validation of a production-level deep learning model using PyTorch Lightning." ;
