<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/ghga-webinar-benchmarking-and-quality-control-for-genomic-variant-calling> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description "In this webinar, you can learn more about ncbench, a powerful benchmarking tool that can be used to evaluate the performance and accuracy of genomic variant calling pipelines. We will also cover other genomic benchmarking-related themes that are crucial in genomic data analysis. This webinar is aimed at students, early career researchers, clinicians, bioinformaticians and everyone interested in the technical details of benchmarking and quality control methods. The webinar will be held by Prof. Johannes Köster from the University Hospital Essen." ;
