<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/gtn-smorgasbord-2022-tapas> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description """Following the overwhelming success of the GTN Smörgåsbord, where we hosted the largest-ever Galaxy training event, we're happy to announce Smörgåsbord 2! A second event with *even more Galaxy Training*\r
\r
\r
We expect to cover all of the same tracks as previous, with the addition of several new modules:\r
\r
- Intro to Galaxy\r
- NGS\r
- RNA-Seq\r
- Single Cell\r
- Proteomics\r
- **New**: SARS-CoV-2 Genomics\r
- **New**: Galaxy Admin Training\r
\r
As before, it will be a global 5-day [Galaxy](https://galaxyproject.org/) Training event showcasing a wide variety of [Galaxy Training Network tutorials](https://training.galaxyproject.org/). This will be an **online** event, spanning **all time zones**. All training sessions are pre-recorded, so you can work through them **at your own pace**, and manage your own time. A large community of GTN trainers will be available via **online support** to answer all your questions.\r
""" ;
