    schema1:description "We live in a world increasingly dominated by data, as this audience is very well aware: from weather forecasting &amp; geolocation mapping to web search &amp; telecommunications; from financial services &amp; econometric modeling to genomic datasets &amp; electronic medical records.  The international public health sector is no exception, with increasing emphasis on large-scale epidemiological studies and data-driven decision-making … as has been very much in evidence during the Covid-19 pandemic." ;
