<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/hackathon-improving-the-annotation-of-galaxy-resources-for-microbial-data-analysis-and-beyond> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:description """This hackathon aims to improve the annotation of Galaxy resources for microbial data analysis and beyond\r
\r
The objective of this hackathon is to improve the annotation of the Galaxy resources (tools, training, workflows) for microbial data analysis by:\r
\r
 - Linking microbial Galaxy tools to bio.tools to obtain EDAM ontology annotation\r
 - Improving bio.tools annotations\r
 - Annotating existing microbial-related tutorials with EDAM terms\r
 - Reflecting on the addition of EDAM terms to workflows\r
 - Reflecting on missing terms in the EDAM ontology for microbial data analyses\r
 - Brainstorming about a way to connect tool annotations to improve training and workflow annotations""" ;
    schema1:endDate "2024-03-15 17:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
    schema1:name "Hackathon - Improving the annotation of Galaxy resources for microbial data analysis and beyond" ;
    schema1:organizer [ a schema1:Organization ;
            schema1:name "AuBi (https://mesocentre.uca.fr/projets-associes/plateforme-aubi), AuBi (https://mesocentre.uca.fr/projets-associes/plateforme-aubi/), IFB (https://www.france-bioinformatique.fr/), IFB Core (https://www.france-bioinformatique.fr/)" ] ;
    schema1:startDate "2024-03-11 09:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
    schema1:url <https://galaxyproject.org/events/2024-03-11-hackathon-galaxy-resources-annotation/#preliminary-schedule> .

<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/hackathon-improving-the-annotation-of-galaxy-resources-for-microbial-data-analysis-and-beyond-d58fcce1-d194-4cb3-99fa-92780c5ee1ba> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description """Educators:\r
Paul Zierep (RBC), Bérénice Batut\r
\r
Date:\r
March 11 - 15, 2024\r
\r
Location:\r
Online\r
\r
Contents:\r
The objective of this hackathon is to improve the annotation of the Galaxy resources (tools, training, workflows) for microbial data analysis by:\r
\r
Linking microbial Galaxy tools to bio.tools to obtain EDAM ontology annotation\r
Improving bio.tools annotations\r
Annotating existing microbial-related tutorials with EDAM terms\r
Reflecting on the addition of EDAM terms to workflows\r
Reflecting on missing terms in the EDAM ontology for microbial data analyses\r
Brainstorming about a way to connect tool annotations to improve training and workflow annotations\r
This hackathon is open to other communities than microGalaxy\r
\r
Learning goals:\r
-  Improve the annotation of the Galaxy resources (tools, training, workflows) for microbial data analysis\r
\r
Prerequisites:\r
None\r
\r
Keywords:\r
Galaxy, Microbial Omics\r
\r
Tools:\r
Galaxy""" ;
