    schema1:contact "Vera Matser" ;
    schema1:description """This course provides an introduction to High-Performance Computing (HPC) for researchers in the life sciences, using ARCHER as a platform for hands-on training exercises.\r
The course is co-organised and funded by BioExcel (http://bioexcel.eu/) and PRACE (http://www.prace-ri.eu/), and delivered in collaboration with ARCHER – the UK national supercomputing service (http://archer.ac.uk).""" ;
