        [ a schema1:Audience ;
            schema1:audienceType "Researchers" ],
        [ a schema1:Audience ;
            schema1:audienceType "PhD students" ] ;
    schema1:description """ELIXIR Norway in cooperation with ELIXIR Slovenia is pleased to announce the first Hands-on workshop in Marine Metagenomics.\r
\r
The aim of the workshop is to introduce the participants to the research field of metagenomics with focus on samples from the marine environment. The theoretical part for each subject will be introduced via lectures, followed by a practical Hands-on session.\r
\r
Place: The Arctic University of Norway, each day from 09.00 until 16.00\r
Target audience: Researcher and students above bachelor level\r
Prerequisite: None, but study or research interest in metagenomics is expected\r
\r
**COURSE FEE: € 250,-**\r
**Deadline for application: November 1, 2018**\r
\r
**[Register here](https://goo.gl/forms/Zw6lk3pAoMdVcykE3)**\r
\r
The maximum number of participants is 20. If the interest for the course is greater than this, we will select participants based on a geographical distribution and on how relevant the workshop will be to the participant.""" ;
