<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/hpc-on-boarding-october-2022> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:coursePrerequisites "The course is aimed at students, researchers and employees of any background. We assume no prior knowledge of what an HPC is or how to use it. For those who have little experience with UNIX-like operating systems such as Linux or who have never worked on the command line of a terminal, we will offer a hands-on pre-course about UNIX a day before the HPC course." ;
    schema1:description """The Norwegian Research Infrastructure Services (NRIS) is offering an on-boarding hands-on course for current and future users of HPC systems.\r
\r
The course is obligatory for all new users of national HPC systems (Saga, Fram, Betzy) and recommended to all interested in the field.""" ;
