<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/image-processing-for-correlated-and-multimodal-imaging-techniques> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:description "The purpose of this event is to dedicate three days of intense training to an audience with little or basic expertise. The program will first cover a full day of online lectures (19 October 2020), followed by two days of hands-on training (8 &amp; 9 March 2021, Ghent)." ;
