<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/impact-and-more-workshop> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:description """This event is open to anyone in ELIXIR interested in impact - please contact Francesca de Leo (f.deleo@ibiom.cnr.it) and Corinne Martin (corinne.martin@elixir-europe.org) if you wish to participate.\r
\r
Intended outcomes of the workshop:\r
\r
\r
	Increased social capital across ELIXIR in the area of impact evaluation and environmental impact;\r
	Improved skills and knowledge in impact evaluation, obtained through formal training, knowledge-exchange, as well as hands-on practical exercises, customised to the needs and interest of research infrastructures; \r
	Increased understanding of environmental issues of relevance to Nodes and how the carbon footprint can be assessed.\r
\r
\r
Participants are strongly encouraged to familiarise themselves, prior to the workshop, with ELIXIR’s key impact-related resources, which include a Toolkit, an Annotated bibliography and a List of indicators.\r
\r
Workshop slides will be added to this page after the event.\r
\r
This event has received funding from ELIXIR, the EU-funded ELIXIR-STEERS project, as well as the ELIXIRxNextGenIT project funded by the Italian government. \r
\r
 """ ;
    schema1:endDate "2024-04-10 14:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
