<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/infographics> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description """Learn how to create engaging infographics on your research!

Because visuals can share much more information in a shorter amount of time, and on a smaller amount of space compared to writing everything down in words. The expression 'a picture is worth a thousand words' is absolutely true. On top of that, a combination of visuals and words engages different parts of the brain at the same time, making it easier for your audience to understand and remember your message.""" ;
