    schema1:alternateName "Webinar #7 Instruct Centre CZ - 17 February 2021" ;
    schema1:description """Instruct-ERIC ‘Structure Meets Function’ webinar hosted by Instruct Centre CZ, the Czech Infrastructure for Integrative Structural Biology (CIISB), on 17 February 2021, 11:00 - 12:30 CET\r
\r
Talk 1: Enterovirus genome release and delivery, Pavel Plevka\r
\r
Talk 2: Sweeping RNA polymerase - role of protein HelD in bacterial transcription, Jan Dohnálek\r
\r
Talk 3: Probing structures and interactions of nucleic acids in living human cells using NMR Spectroscopy, Lukáš Trantírek\r
\r
Moderator: Vladimír Sklenář\r
\r
Find more details including the registration link in the attached leaflet or on the Instruct-ERIC web pages\r
https://instruct-eric.eu/content/instructeric-webinar-series-structure-meets-function""" ;
