    schema1:description "The meeting will focus on engaging with RIRs and EIP services and discussing the communication strategy on EIP tasks across different projects (EOSC, FAIRplus, CONVERGE, EJP-RD, GA4GH, etc). We encourage participation both from within the the EIP community, and outside (other platforms, and use case communities), and both strategy leadership and engineering development levels. Key participant groups for each session are noted, but all sessions are open to all audiences. " ;
