<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/intravital-microscopy-training> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description "This one-day training day in Intravital Imaging techniques and setups will aim to showcase a variety of intravital imaging techniques and is preceded by the 4th Day of Intravital Microscopy. The day will start out with a small seminar series in the morning explaining and breaking down intravital imaging surgical techniques as well as imaging setups used. The training day will then conclude in the afternoon with live demonstrations of abdominal, thoracic and cranial imaging windows and imaging on our 2 inhouse 2-photon Leica SP8 (upright) and DIVE (inverted) microscopes as well as a novel intravital aiming system IVM-CMS3 demoed by IVIM Technologies." ;
