<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/introduction-to-data-management-for-peatland-research-and-monitoring> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:coursePrerequisites "Participants are encouraged to familiarise themselves with the Galaxy platform and the available training materials." ;
    schema1:description """This workshop will introduce FAIR (Findable, Accessible, Interoperable and Reusable) data management, research data lifecycle and the importance of creating a data management plan for peatland research and monitoring. Creating data management at the start of a project or monitoring planning facilitates data management and reuse.\r
Join a hands-on session to develop a data management plan for peatland monitoring and research.""" ;
