    schema1:description " https://nbisweden.github.io/workshop-dm-practices/ Introduction to Data Management Practices National course open for PhD students, postdocs, researchers and other employees within all Swedish universities. The course is geared towards life scientists wanting to take the first steps towards a more systematic and reproducible approach to analysing and managing research data. " ;
