    schema1:description "ELIXIR Slovenia and HPC Carpentry invite you to attend a two-day course **Introduction to high-performance computing**. The event will take place on **Thursday, January 27 (9:30 - 16:30 CET), and on Friday, January 28 (9:30-15:00 CET)**. Participation in the course is possible either in a **classroom in Ljubljana (Faculty of Medicine) or remotely**. The course teacher will be **Alan O’Cais** from HPC Carpentry. Please fill in a [registration form](https://elixir.mf.uni-lj.si/course/view.php?id=81) if you would like to attend the course. You can find more info about the course in a [course summary](https://elixir.mf.uni-lj.si/course/view.php?id=77) on **ELIXIR-SI eLearning Platform (EeLP)**." ;
