    schema1:coursePrerequisites " University of Bradford staff and students" ;
    schema1:description """Day 2 Guidance for new HPC users - Moving to the HPC\r
For anyone who is new to cluster computing or who has very limited experience using HPC systems. After the module, the attendee will be able to:\r
• Confidently access the HPC\r
• Manage their file system usage\r
• Understand how standard software is accessed using the module system\r
• Build environments for their codes e.g. using Conda\r
• Run their codes via SLURM ensuring resources and environments are correctly loaded""" ;
