<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/introduction-to-ngs-analysis> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description """This course combines e-learning with live online sessions.
________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

This training is an introduction to 'Bulk RNASeq analysis for differential expression', and 'Hands on introduction to ChIPSeq analysis'. If you want to follow one of these trainings and you have no experience with NGS data you should follow this introduction first. The course will not prepare you for the single cell trainings. 

Since part of the course is done via e-learning you have to take into account that you will have to spend time to this course outside of class.""" ;
