<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/introduction-to-r-course> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:description """Introduction to R course - May 2022\r
R is a highly used programming language for visualisation of data and statistical analysis. There are many R packages for the analysis of biological datasets. This course is aimed at beginners and novices to R. It will give an in depth overview of the foundations of R and Rstudio plus introduce data sorting, visualisation and statistical analysis.\r
\r
Places are restricted to UK-based researchers and only 25 places are available so please only register if you intend on attending.\r
\r
Attendees are required to attend all four sessions; these will be on 17, 19, 24, 26 May 2022, 10am-4pm.\r
\r
The deadline to register is Friday 29/04.""" ;
    schema1:endDate "2022-05-17 17:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
    schema1:name "Introduction to R course " ;
    schema1:organizer [ a schema1:Organization ;
            schema1:name "NEOF" ] ;
    schema1:startDate "2022-05-17 09:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
