<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/introduction-to-structural-variant-detection-analyses-2022> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description """Program\r
\r
*  Handling mapping tools suitable for ILLUMINA and ONT data (bwa, minimap2)\r
*  SNP detection from mapping of short reads against a reference genome: SNP calling, filters and SNP annotation. Examples of possible studies based on SNP arrays\r
* Detecting Structural Variations (SV) in short and long reads (breakdancer, sniffle)\r
* SV detection from genome assembly and comparison (minimap2, nucmer, assemblytics, siry)""" ;
