<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/introduction-to-vib-forms> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description """VIB has created the VIB forms application to simplify data collection and compilation. This application is open for all VIB staff to start making your own surveys and automate your data collection processes, without any prior coding knowledge.

VIB forms:


	has a user-friendly design
	allows you to customize privacy settings
	authenticity of all input data is verified
	allows to create templates for re-use
	is easily integrable with other VIB tools
	 allows for gathering detailed statistics on the collected data


More information: https://forms.sites.vib.be/en

 """ ;
