___________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

The course will consist of:


	a theoretical session to explain the statistics behind Prism8
	videos and a live demo session to show you how to do statistics in Prism8
	two Q&amp;A sessions where your questions will be answered and where you apply this knowledge on your own data or on real-life example data""" ;
