<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/ip-workshop> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description "IP profession and Biotech patenting for creating valorisable outcomes of your researchThis workshop gives the opportunity to the VIB Scientists to take a first dive into building up an IP strategy and a patent portfolio to create value from their research findings in a hands-on manner.The particulars of protecting inventions and the patenting process will be showcased based on examples, with the aim to provide practical introduction to patentability analysis and scope of an invention. Finally, IP managers of the VIB Innovation and Business team will give personal insights in the role of a Patent Attorney in academia, industry, or a law firm, and share their experiences and expertise in patent portfolio creation, advising of PI's and clients and share some tips for participants willing to pursue an IP career in future. " ;
