<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/leadership-workshop-feedback-exchange> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description """We plan to offer this training in classroom. However, if  a live training is not be possible due to measurements that we need to take to prevent spreading of the Corona virus, this training will be offered digitally.

 

Creating an environment in which people are motivated to give the best they got, cannot be done overnight. An open and constructive atmosphere requires a lot of effort, time and commitment from the group leaders, experts and other supervisory personnel. Through the VIB HR strategy we wish to offer the possibilities and the tools to create just that kind of environment.

Besides offering a vast array of scientific programs and challenges, it is important that we keep on focusing on the 'human' aspects in the daily working life of all our collaborators. We should have constant attention for training (scientific and non-scientific) and well-being of which open and constructive feedback are vital components.""" ;
    schema1:hasCourseInstance [ a schema1:CourseInstance ;
            dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/CourseInstance/1.0-RELEASE> ;
            schema1:courseMode "onsite" ;
            schema1:endDate "2020-10-23 17:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
            schema1:organizer [ a schema1:Organization ;
                    schema1:name "VIB" ] ;
            schema1:startDate "2020-10-23 09:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ] ;
    schema1:inLanguage "en" ;
    schema1:keywords "leadership & management" ;
    schema1:name "Leadership workshop: Feedback exchange" ;
    schema1:provider [ a schema1:Organization ;
            schema1:name "VIB Training" ;
            schema1:url <https://training.vib.be/> ] ;
    schema1:url <https://training.vib.be/all-trainings/leadership-workshop-feedback-exchange> .

