<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/learn-the-essentials-of-research-data-management-and-microbial-genome-submissions-eccb2024> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:description """Educators:\r
Helena Schnitzer, Daniel Wibberg (FZ Jülich / de.NBI / ELIXIR-DE)\r
\r
Date:\r
17. Sept. 2023\r
\r
Location:\r
Turku - ECCB 2024\r
\r
Contents:\r
Have you ever wondered what research data management really is? Why is it so important? Then ELIXIR-DE has created the perfect training for you!\r
\r
More and more funders require the establishment of research data management plans to distribute their grants. Over the course of just three hours, you get the chance to learn about how to transfer research project proposals into proper Data Management Plans (DMPs). Data management experts will guide you through the basics of research data management, the dos and don’ts and how to improve the management of the data produced in research projects. After a short introduction of the research data life cycle and the FAIR data principles, we will explore in multiple hands-on sessions what a data management plan (DMP) is. We will sink our teeth into components, language, software and examples of DMPs. In light of the FAIR principles, we will evaluate possible problems and solutions and self-assess a drafted DMP for our own projects.\r
\r
Learning goals:\r
- Know the research life cycle\r
- Know the FAIR principles and understand their importance\r
- Know the expectations for a DMP\r
- Be able to sketch a DMP\r
\r
Prerequisites:\r
None\r
\r
Keywords:\r
Research data management, planning, FAIR\r
\r
Tools:\r
- Computer with internet connection, webcam, and microphone\r
- Browser""" ;
    schema1:endDate "2024-09-17 17:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
    schema1:event_types "meetings_and_conferences" ;
    schema1:location [ a schema1:Place ;
            schema1:address [ a schema1:PostalAddress ;
                    schema1:addressCountry "Finland" ;
                    schema1:addressLocality "Turku" ;
                    schema1:addressRegion "Turku" ;
                    schema1:streetAddress "Turku" ] ;
            schema1:latitude "60.451813" ;
            schema1:longitude "22.26663" ] ;
    schema1:name "Learn the essentials of research data management and Microbial genome submissions - ECCB2024" ;
    schema1:organizer [ a schema1:Organization ;
            schema1:name "de.NBI / ELIXIR-DE" ] ;
    schema1:startDate "2024-09-17 13:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
    schema1:url <https://www.denbi.de/training-courses-2024/1720-learn-the-essentials-of-research-data-management-and-microbial-genome-submissions-eccb2024> .

