    schema1:description "Cambridge Healthtech Institute's Second Annual Leveraging Pharmacies for Rapid Diagnostics will showcase outcomes data and practice models, an overview of the diagnostics landscape, and bring in the payor perspective. Legal considerations will be discussed from state-to-state practice laws to pharmacy-based CLIA waivers and Collaborative Practice Acts. Overall, this event will bring together representatives from both diagnostics and pharmacy to continue planning a path forward." ;
