    schema1:audience [ a schema1:Audience ;
            schema1:audienceType "mixed audience" ] ;
    schema1:description """NanoCommons, in collaboration with the EU NanoSafety Cluster projects, organises the “Nano-week” and NanoCommons Final Conference, in Limassol, Cyprus.\r
\r
The theme of the conference is “Evolution of Nanosafety and materials sustainability as we transition into Horizon Europe”.\r
\r
The conference and associated events (e.g., Young NanoSafety Researchers event, Training events, EU-US CoRs meeting, NanoInChi meeting, NSC meeting) will take place between 20 – 24 June 2022.\r
\r
Key dates\r
\r
    12th Jan 2022: Call for abstracts opens\r
    25th February 2022:  Closing date for abstracts for ORAL PRESENTATIONS\r
    31st May 2022: Deadline for POSTER abstract submission\r
\r
For any queries mail us at nanoweek2022@novamechanics.com""" ;
