    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description "This course will give an introduction to the concept of Neural Networks (NN) and Deep Learning. Topics covered will include: NN building blocks, including concepts such as neurons, activation functions, loss functions, gradient descent and back-propagation; Convolutional Neural Networks; Recursive Neural Networks; Autoencoders; and best practices when designing NNs," ;
