Places are restricted to UK-based researchers and only 30 places are available so please only register if you intend on attending.\r
\r
The online workshop will be held over one day on Tuesday 8th October 2024, 10am-4pm, with registration opening at 9.30am.\r
\r
The deadline to register is Monday 23 September, 2 weeks before the course. You will hear later that week whether you have been invited and will need to confirm your attendance.\r
\r
Register to NEOF mailing list to hear first about future NEOF free bioinformatics courses: https://neof.org.uk/news/""" ;
