		\r
	\r
\r
\r
More information including programme and accomodation details will be available shortly. \r
\r
It is hoped that people will be able to attend in person but we recognise this might not always be possible for a variety of reasons. It will be possible to join a Zoom call for each although this will be very much a second-best experience. """ ;
