<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/pangaea-community-workshop-2025-fair-data-publications-with-pangaea> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description """Educators:\r
PANGAEA Training team (BioData)\r
\r
Date:\r
13.11.2025 10:30 – 12:30\r
14.11.2025 10:30 – 12:30\r
\r
Location:\r
Online\r
\r
Contents:\r
Join us for a 2-day, 4-hour workshop on FAIR data publications with PANGAEA, where you will learn how to efficiently prepare, submit, and publish your research data. Through a balanced mix of theory, hands-on practice, and live demonstrations, participants will experience the full process of data submission—from initial upload to editorial review—while gaining insights into best practices, authors’ guidelines, automation options, and practical templates for major data types. This event is ideal for researchers seeking to enhance their data publication workflow and ensure their datasets are shared openly and effectively through PANGAEA.\r
\r
Have a look at the agenda to get an idea what we have in the pipeline for you.\r
\r
Learning goals: \r
Be able to follow best practices in data management, and all recommended steps for preparing and submitting scientific results of earth, biodiversity, and environmental research to a FAIR data repository like PANGAEA.\r
\r
Prerequisites: \r
non\r
\r
Keywords:\r
PANGAEA, FAIR-Data Publication\r
\r
Tools: \r
PANGAEA Submission Form""" ;
