<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/popular-science-writing-691c3e67-df12-44e0-89ab-f136cf3427b5> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description """How do you write for a broad audience?

Would you like to share your research with a general audience, but you don't know where to start? In this online training, we guide you through the process, from idea to publication.

During an online workshop on 12 September, our coach Amy Leblanc reveals all the secrets of a popular science text.

During the workshop we immediately roll up our sleeves: you develop the concept of your own article, and you start writing.

You will continue the writing process at home and send the first version to our coach.

But you are not alone: ​​you may repeat the most important lessons online. We will try to inspire you with many good examples, in different styles, forms, and genres.

You also receive individual feedback on your text on 3 or 4 October.

As icing on the cake, we will help you to get your work published by our media partner Biovox, on the website of The Conversation,... we will help you find the most suitable platform!""" ;
    schema1:hasCourseInstance [ a schema1:CourseInstance ;
            dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/CourseInstance/1.0-RELEASE> ;
            schema1:courseMode "online" ;
            schema1:endDate "2024-10-04 17:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
            schema1:funder [ a schema1:Organization ;
                    schema1:name "SciComm Academy" ] ;
            schema1:organizer [ a schema1:Organization ;
                    schema1:name "VIB" ] ;
            schema1:startDate "2024-09-12 09:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ] ;
    schema1:inLanguage "en" ;
    schema1:keywords "communication skills" ;
    schema1:name "Popular Science Writing" ;
    schema1:provider [ a schema1:Organization ;
            schema1:name "VIB Training" ;
            schema1:url <https://training.vib.be/> ] ;
    schema1:url <https://training.vib.be/all-trainings/popular-science-writing-4> .

<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/popular-science-writing-6a62c633-78c8-4024-bf51-51db5f5db906> a schema1:Course ;
