<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/professional-skillset-training-for-support-staff-self-leadership-communication> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description """Introduction to a fresh and pragmatic approach to self-leadership and communication within your daily  work routine.

 

In this initial module of the professional skillset training, our focus is on enhancing your communication skills to boost efficiency, fortify connections with your manager &amp; team, amplify your impact, and foster well-being in the workplace. While understanding how to communicate effectively is essential, the true test lies in its practical application. So, through role-playing exercises, hands-on communication drills and immersive real-life scenario analysis, you'll have the opportunity to experiment with your communication and presentation style within a supportive environment, fostering shared growth and experience.

Questions such as "How should I navigate this situation?”, "What defines leadership for me?" and "I have a message, but how do I effectively convey it?" will be addressed. We'll delve deeper into your unique talents and abilities, exploring your leadership DNA and providing you with tools to unlock your leadership potential.""" ;
    schema1:hasCourseInstance [ a schema1:CourseInstance ;
            dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/CourseInstance/1.0-RELEASE> ;
