    schema1:description """The location of this event has changed to the Park Inn by Radisson Brussels Midi hotel! Please find the location below. 

This community event is kindly provided to you by the ELIXIR Belgium team and aims to gather all relevant players in the field of Research Data Management from Belgium. During the morning session you will get insights in all different topics of the DMP life cycle with several speakers elaborating on the topics mentioned here below. In the afternoon there will be a practical use-case session for a smaller group where we will dive into some tools and workflows that follow the FAIR principles and are currently used. During the whole day there will be possibilities to network.

Full program details &amp; speakers can be found below!""" ;
