<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/rethinking-time-management> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description "Overwhelmed by endless to-do lists, constant distractions, and the pressure of a fast-changing work environment? You’re not alone. Traditional time management no longer works in today’s world of information overload. What truly matters is not your time – it’s your attention. This training will show you how to shift from juggling time to mastering focus, clarity, and productivity." ;
