<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/retrieving-biological-data-from-embl-ebi-resources-using-dbfetch> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:about <http://edamontology.org/data_0857>,
        <http://edamontology.org/data_2193>,
        <http://edamontology.org/operation_2421> ;
    schema1:description """Dbfetch provides a single point of access to retrieve biological data entries from various databases at EMBL-EBI.

This webinar will provide a brief overview of the Dbfetch service and illustrate various output formats of data retrievable via Dbfetch. In addition to the web browser-based applications of Dbfetch, we will also demonstrate accessing Dbfetch using the API.""" ;
