<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/single-cell-rna-seq-data-analysis-29584a6c-8653-4590-bcf6-7497417370ab> a schema1:Course ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description """This workshop will introduce the best practice bioinformatics methods for analysing single cell RNA-seq data via a series of lectures and computer practicals. The total course duration is 5 days which includes 4 days of lectures and exercises followed by a "Bring Your Own Data" (BYOD) day where you get to practice your skills on a dataset of your choosing. Please note that the BYOD section will take place the week after the lectures. 

Practical exercises will be performed using either R or Python, so we only accept students that fullfil the entry requirements below.""" ;
