						Christine Orengo (UCL)\r
					Plants and Agriculture\r
						Klaas Vandepoele (VIB)\r
                                       Biodiversity\r
						Donat Agosti (Plazi)\r
				\r
			\r
		\r
		\r
			11:00 - 11:30\r
			Coffee break\r
		\r
		\r
			11:30 - 12:15\r
			Breakout sessions on Scientific Topics\r
		\r
		\r
			12:15 - 13:00\r
			Lunch\r
		\r
		\r
			13:00 - 13:45\r
			\r
				Enabling collaborations - ELIXIR in the European landscape\r
\r
				\r
					Data Management\r
						Hilary Hanahoe (RDA)\r
					EOSC\r
						Per Öster (CSC)\r
