    schema1:description """In this one-day workshop, which is of introductory character, we aim to familiarize the audience with the requirements and challenges of the genomics and metagenomics analysis in the Galaxy platform.\r
Topics will include:\r
Introduction to Metagenomic Analysis- main features of the ANASTASIA platform\r
Introduction to the GALAXY platform\r
