    schema1:description "The Theo Murphy Australian Frontiers is hosting a three day conference for early and mid-career researchers working in Australia or neighbouring countries in the field of microbiology. The meeting focuses on the living environment, the human microbiome and the study of microbiomes. The symposium is an excellent opportunity for young Australians to come together and discuss the emerging technologies, new opportunities and exciting cutting-edge innovations in their fields. " ;
