<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/total-nanosafe-hybrid-conference-from-molecules-to-public-health> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:audience [ a schema1:Audience ;
            schema1:audienceType "Life Science Researchers" ] ;
    schema1:description """Total NanoSafe Hybrid Conference – From Molecules to Public Health, Nov 11 &amp; 12, 2021 at the International Nanotechnology Laboratories in Braga, Portugal.\r
\r
\r
The ‘Total-Nanosafe’ Hybrid Conference is bringing experts in different fields related to the use of nanomaterials, nanotechnology and how these are related to different aspects of safety, regarding health and environment.\r
\r
\r
Submit Your Abstract: The deadline for submitting your abstract to the event TOTAL - NANOSAFE: From Molecules to Public Health is approaching! You have until October 26th to send it to us and take an active part in this International Conference. Show us your work in nanomaterials, nanotechnology and how these are related to different aspects of safety, regarding health and the environment, specifically in these topics:\r
\r
- Nanomaterials Toxicity\r
\r
- Cells and Organs on Chip\r
\r
- Cheminformatics and in Silico Tools\r
\r
- Epigenetics\r
\r
\r
List of speakers:\r
\r
Day One (November 11th)\r
\r
Keynote talk: Flemming Cassee\r
\r
Session 1: Toxicological assessment of Nanomaterials\r
\r
- Martin Himly\r
\r
- Peter Hoet\r
\r
- Hanna Karlsson\r
\r
- Vania Vilas-Boas\r
\r
Break\r
\r
\r
Keynote talk: Peter Loskill\r
\r
Session 2: Complex cell culture and organ-on-chip\r
\r
- Arno Gutleb\r
\r
- Nina Hobi or Janick Stucki\r
\r
- Lorena Dieguez\r
\r
- Liliana Teixeira\r
\r
- Ana Ribeiro\r
\r
\r
Day Two (November 12th)\r
\r
Keynote Speaker: Jose Luís Medina Franco\r
\r
Session 3: Cheminformatics and in silico tools\r
\r
- Andrey Toropov\r
\r
- Timothy E H Allen\r
\r
- Eli Fernández de Gortari\r
\r
Break\r
\r
\r
Session 4: From molecules to public health\r
\r
- Begoña Espiña\r
\r
- Basak Engin\r
\r
- Manosij Ghosh\r
\r
- Pauliina Damdimopoulou\r
\r
- Tim Nawrot\r
\r
- Nivedita Chatterjee""" ;
    schema1:endDate "2021-11-12 17:00:00 UTC"^^schema1:Date ;
    schema1:event_types "meetings_and_conferences" ;
    schema1:funder [ a schema1:Organization ;
            schema1:name "NanoCommons" ] ;
