\r
The Training Platform, including all of ELIXIR’s Training Coordinators will meet to share updates and jointly work on open Training related aspects and ELIXIR Training Platform tasks.\r
\r
This year is particularly important in light of the 2024-2028 Scientific Programme Developments\r
\r
The meeting will include presentations covering both past and future activities and participant engagement.\r
\r
Please see the Preliminary Programme\r
\r
Date\r
