    schema1:description "Translational Medicine 2017 is the third bi-annual conference organised by EATRIS (European Infrastructure for Translational Medicine). This event will bring together experts and key actors in translational research, to discuss current approaches and future perspectives in the ﬁeld. The theme of the 2017 edition is “Enhancing Predictivity in Medicines Development” and will focus on the latest approaches to increase chances of success in drug development, from novel in vitro systems to new biomarkers or clinical trial methodology for patient selection and stratification." ;
