    schema1:description "Embrace lifelong learning to elevate your science career and personal growth! Are you interested in improving your current scientific or transferable skills to help develop your career? Take this chance to get a sneak preview into VIB's top-notch, fully integrated training and conference program so that you can expand your knowledge and build valuable networks. Discover why VIB is an attractive workplace and take your career to the next level. If you need even more incentives, we will raffle tickets for upcoming training and conferences among attendees. Don't miss out on this opportunity to grow and connect! " ;
