    schema1:description "“Improving Science Through Sustainability – How Greener Practice Can Enhance Research”Applying sustainable practices in a lab environment is often seen as conflicting with the excellence in science we all strive for. Patrick Penndorf, researcher in molecular medicine (Neuroimmunology &amp; Epigenetics), proves that efficient sustainable practices can actually improve both scientific work and well-being of researchers." ;
