<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/events/webinar-making-container-services-integratable-sustainable-and-widely-used> a schema1:Event ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Event/0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_14> ;
    schema1:description """This webinar will present the outcomes of the Strategic Implementation Study "Making container services integratable, sustainable and widely used"\r
\r
WP1 was focused on fostering community and user engagement across ELIXIR in the area of containers\r
	WP2 was focused on providing user support for adopting the services and solutions proposed within this Conatiners focused study e.g. deployment of workflows available in WorkflowHub in a cloud environment\r
	WP3 supported the efforts of conatiner service providers in adopting the different standards, protocols and developments that enable users to access and utilize the services detailed in WP2.\r
	WP4 specifically looked after the mechanisms to ensure the sustainability of the service portfolio assembled in this Containers focused study\r
\r
This work follows on from previous Implementation Studies: Deploying Reproducible Containers and Workflows Across Cloud Environment\r
\r
\r
	\r
