            schema1:audienceType "Life Science Researchers" ] ;
    schema1:description """The Minimal Information About Plant Phenotyping Experiment, MIAPPE (www.miappe.org) has been designed by ELIXIR, EMPHASIS and Bioversity international to guide plant scientists in the management of experimental data and to facilitate integration with genotyping data.The webinar gives an overview of the current practices and methods for plant phenotyping data standardization.\r
\r
A recording of the webinar is available:https://youtu.be/Fq2j16jzdBA\r
\r
The webinar was organized in the frame of the AGENT and GenRes Bridge projects that received funding from the European Union’s Horizon 2020 research and innovation programme under respective grant agreements No 862613, and No 817580.""" ;
