    schema1:description """The next Workflow4Experimenters session (2025) will take place from in May 2025. During this one-week course (entirely in English), you will learn how to use the infrastructure and analyze your own LC-MS, GC-MS, or NMR data.\r
\r
For this new session, format changed:\r
- From April, 28th to 30th: online theoreticalsessions (methods and tools). This session is only accessible to person who will be present in Rouen for the onsite session.\r
- From May, 12th to 16th: tutoring on your own data, PBS Laboratory Rouen (Rouen University, Campus de Mont Saint-Aignan, France, close to Paris).""" ;
