    schema1:teaches """By the end of the workshop you should be able to:\r
\r
- List the steps involved in RNAseq data processing and differential expression analysis\r
- Understand key concepts and considerations for RNAseq experiments \r
- Describe the benefits of using nf-core workflows\r
- Run the nf-core/rnaseq workflow to perform:\r
    - Quality control\r
    - Read alignment\r
    - Read quantification to generate raw counts\r
- Use R/RStudio on to perform:\r
    - Quality control\r
    - Identify differentially expressed genes \r
    - Perform functional enrichment/pathway analysis""" ;
