    schema1:description "In 2022, we continued to develop a huge range of online training from trainers across EMBL-EBI and beyond, from a series of webinars discussing the impact of the protein structure database, AlphaFold, to a collection on biocuration and the skills required to be a biocurator. To celebrate this year of training, we've brought together some of our highlights to help you discover what we have to offer. " ;
