    schema1:description "To celebrate this year of EMBL-EBI on-demand training we've brought together some exciting new training from across the year that you can access anytime from anywhere.Discover new on-demand training which introduces a variety of different topics in bioinformatics such as spatial omics and microbial ecosystems, plus there's loads of up-to-date training on EMBL-EBI data resources. " ;
