    schema1:author [ a schema1:Person ;
            schema1:name "Sven Degroeve" ] ;
    schema1:competencyRequired """### Required skills\r
\r
Models are build in the Python programming language​ so basic knowledge of Python is a plus. """ ;
    schema1:creativeWorkStatus "active" ;
    schema1:dateCreated "2023-05-02"^^schema1:Date ;
    schema1:description """### Course content\r
\r
https://github.com/sdgroeve/Machine-Learning-Course-2days \r
This repository contains the Jupyter notebooks for the VIB course on Machine Learning: ["A tour of Machine Learning: classification"](https://training.vib.be/all-trainings/tour-machine-learning-classification). \r
\r
\r
You can fork this to your own repository to obtain a working copy. Each notebook contains a button to run the code in Google Colaboratory. \r
\r
The lectures can be watched [on Youtube](https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLv5LrvIzDSWZXAyIJmXgQ-ezCFELN8b5e). More lecture can be found [here](https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLXxp6nsBenSWGYnoZjCGCQ0tGdg7bI3na). \r
\r
You will enjoy competing against each other to fit the best performing model in [the Kaggle competition](https://www.kaggle.com/c/a-tour-of-machine-learning-2021). \r
\r
### Further learning \r
\r
Coursera ML course: https://www.coursera.org/learn/machine-learning \r
Kaggle learning: https://www.kaggle.com/learn/overview and https://www.kaggle.com/sashr07/kaggle-titanic-tutorial""" ;
    schema1:educationalLevel "intermediate" ;
    schema1:keywords "Deep Learning",
        "Machine Learning" ;
    schema1:learningResourceType "hands-on tutorial" ;
    schema1:license <https://spdx.org/licenses/CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0.html> ;
    schema1:name "A tour of Machine Learning" ;
    schema1:provider [ a schema1:Organization ;
            schema1:name "ELIXIR Belgium" ;
            schema1:url <https://www.elixir-belgium.org/training> ],
        [ a schema1:Organization ;
            schema1:name "VIB Training" ;
            schema1:url <https://training.vib.be/> ] ;
    schema1:url <https://elearning.vib.be/courses/a-tour-of-machine-learning/> ;
    schema1:version "1.0" .

