<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/materials/an-introduction-to-the-covid-19-data-portal> a schema1:LearningResource ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/TrainingMaterial/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description """The COVID-19 Data Portal was launched in April 2020 to bring together relevant datasets and tools for sharing and analysis in an effort to accelerate coronavirus research. It enables researchers to upload, access and analyse COVID-19 related reference data and specialist datasets.\r
\r
This webinar will provide an introduction to the COVID-19 Data Portal, discuss the kind of data that is made available and include a demonstration of how to access data.""" ;
