    schema1:provider [ a schema1:Organization ;
            schema1:name "ELIXIR Estonia" ;
            schema1:url <https://elixir.ut.ee> ] ;
    schema1:teaches """* Obtain basic knowledge on dealing with files using command line (Linux or Mac)\r
* Learn how to use search over several text files, combine files, extract certain knowledge.\r
* Tips and tricks for effective command line hacks that would save a lot of time.""" ;
