        [ a schema1:Person ;
            schema1:name "Celia W.G. van Gelder" ],
        [ a schema1:Person ;
            schema1:name "Daniel Faria" ] ;
    schema1:description """BioData.pt | ELIXIR Portugal, in collaboration with several other organizations has designed a program to train the first generation of Data Stewards for the life sciences, to support the implementation of data management, open science and FAIR data principles in Portuguese R&amp;I organizations. These are the materials of the introductory module covering the basic concepts of Data Stewardship followed by two assignments and end with a hands-on course for knowledge consolidation.\r
\r
After this program, trainees will be able to make significant contribution in:\r
\r
- Writing data management plans in support to grant applications\r
\r
- Ensuring continuity and sharing of data over projects\r
\r
- Ensuring data quality\r
\r
- Supporting the elaboration of institutional data management guidelines\r
\r
- Supporting compliance with institution data management policy\r
\r
- Contributing to knowledge exchange with regard to data management""" ;
    schema1:educationalLevel "beginner" ;
    schema1:identifier "10.5281/zenodo.6599750" ;
    schema1:keywords "Data Integration",
        "Data management plan",
