    schema1:teaches """By the end of the course, participants will be able to:\r
\r
- independently prepare HiC libraries of low-complexity samples.\r
- prepare HiC libraries at their home labs.\r
- understand the most crucial steps of the protocol\r
- troubleshoot crucial steps of the protocol in their home labs when applied to high-complexity samples""" ;
    schema1:url <https://scilifelab-training.github.io/BGE-HiC-course/> ;
    schema1:version "v.1-full" .

