    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/TrainingMaterial/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description "The Bioinformatics resources for protein biology virtual course, which introduced data resources and tools developed by EMBL-EBI that can help in protein studies, ran in April 2023. Here, we have made the course materials available for you to access any time." ;
