    schema1:author [ a schema1:Person ;
            schema1:name "Jan Taylor" ] ;
    schema1:description """Clinical Bioinformatics I is a 10 credit module of the new MSc in Clinical Bioinformatics, delivered by Nowgen/NGRL and the University of Manchester in the UK. Clinical Bioinformatics is one of the streams of the NHS Scientific Training Programme (STP). The programme is a mixture of work placement based training interspersed with academic teaching. 
The tutor notes describe the content taught on each day of the 5 day course, and the approach used to teach the materials. Each day is divided into two parts, a series of lectures in the morning to introduce the topics, then the afternoon sessions present a series of case studies for the students to work through in a 'problem based learning (PBL) approach to reinforce the lecture content. """ ;
