    schema1:datePublished "2022-10-18"^^schema1:Date ;
    schema1:description """Genomics teaches data management and analysis for genomics research including: (1) best practices for organization of bioinformatics projects and data, (2) use of command-line utilities to connect to and use cloud computing and storage resources, (3) use of command-line tools for data preparation, (4) use of command-line tools to analyze sequence quality and perform and automate variant calling.\r
\r
The module is designed for a four half-day, tutor-led workshop, or for self study.""" ;
