    schema1:description """## Abstract

Galaxy *[Special Interest Group](https://galaxyproject.org/community/sig)* (**SIG**)s work hard to build and maintain training resources. The GTN has worked hard to acknowledge this and offer nice impact pages to communities.


## About This Material

This is a Hands-on Tutorial from the GTN which is usable either for individual self-study, or as a teaching material in a classroom.


## Questions this  will address

 - What content does my Topic automatically get from the GTN?
 - How can I make sure this data is collected well?


## Learning Objectives

- Signpost community leads and users to useful resources
- Explain why metadata is key for such community resources
- Provide a reference, rather than a tutorial""" ;
    schema1:educationalLevel "beginner" ;
    schema1:keywords "Galaxy Community Building" ;
    schema1:learningResourceType "e-learning" ;
    schema1:license <https://spdx.org/licenses/CC-BY-4.0.html> ;
    schema1:name "Creating community content" ;
    schema1:provider [ a schema1:Organization ;
            schema1:name "GTN" ;
            schema1:url <https://training.galaxyproject.org/> ] ;
    schema1:teaches """- Signpost community leads and users to useful resources
- Explain why metadata is key for such community resources
- Provide a reference, rather than a tutorial""" ;
    schema1:url <https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/topics/community/tutorials/community_content/tutorial.html> ;
    schema1:version "4" .

