    schema1:description """This webinar will demonstrate how to create more complex queries by combining the PDBe search API with numerous other calls. By introducing specific case studies, we will highlight the scope of PDBe programmatic access.\r
\r
This webinar is part of a 6-part PDBe API webinar series, introducing different levels of programmatic access at PDBe.The series will range from basic data retrieval and search using the PDBe API to more advanced features, including access and reuse of PDBe data visualisation components.""" ;
    schema1:learningResourceType "Recorded webinar" ;
    schema1:license <file:///home/runner/work/ELIXIR-TrP-KG-training-metadata/ELIXIR-TrP-KG-training-metadata/notspecified> ;
