    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/TrainingMaterial/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:description "The Data visualisation for biology course, which focused on data visualisation for exploring complex and multi-dimensional biological data, ran in May 2023. Here, we have made the course materials available for you to access any time." ;
