        [ a schema1:Audience ;
            schema1:audienceType "healthcare professionals" ] ;
    schema1:description """Online course on the landscape of translational medicine\r
An online course for the next generation of translational scientists (PhDs, Postdocs and MDs) is touching upon key aspects of translational research and medicines development. You will learn more about target validation, predictive models, biomarkers, clinical trials, IP and European regulations through a variety of learning activities such as reading assignments, videos, quizzes and mindmaps. The course is self-paced and upon successful completion of the course, a certificate can be obtained. Student investment time for the whole course approximately 10 hours.\r
Webinar series on neuroimaging and quality &amp; reproducibility.\r
https://e-learning.transmedacademy.eu/login.php?target=&amp;client_id=eatris&amp;auth_stat=""" ;
    schema1:educationalLevel "advanced" ;
    schema1:keywords "Rare Diseases & Research" ;
