    schema1:description """In this video, the ELIXIR resources are presented by Peter Maccallum (ELIXIR Hub) as well as the RDMkit and the Data Stewardship Wizard by Laura Portell Silva (INB/ELIXIR-ES).\r
\r
Agenda\r
Tuesday, 1st February 2022\r
00:19 Welcome and introduction\r
02:37 Marlies Dorloechter (NEURON Cofund coordinator, DLR, Germany) - Participants’ expectations collection.\r
09:59 ELIXIR resources - Peter Maccallum (Chief Technical Officer at ELIXIR-Hub)\r
45:25 Data Management Plans tools:  ELIXIR Research Data Management Kit (RDM-kit) and Data Stewardship Wizard\r
Laura Portell (Barcelona Supercomputing Center, ELIXIR-ES)\r
01:13:07 Q/A session - Feedback from participants""" ;
