    schema1:description "Webinars mainly address very rare diseases, complex disorders, highly specialized procedures and implementation of guidelines. At the same time, webinars' programs that are specifically addressed to patients intend to increase the awareness on a specific rare hematological disease among patients' advocates and patients associations." ;
