    schema1:description "\"Evolution Academy\" videos (http://post.queensu.ca/~forsdyke/videolectures.htm). The latter are a course of 54 short (15 min) videos that follow the style of Salman Khan's \"Khan Academy,\" and are addressed primarily to High School and beginning College students. There are also several longer (1 h) conference presentations that bring together various themes. These are backed by several webpages (accessible by way of http://post.queensu.ca/~forsdyke/homepage.htm ), and a textbook, now in its third edition (2016; for Introduction see Materials File)." ;
