    schema1:description """This eLearning course on "Experimental Techniques for the Characterization of Intrinsically Disordered Proteins" collects a series of webinars designed to provide you with comprehensive insights into the latest methods and technologies used in the study of these unique proteins. Led by expert researchers in the field, each session will explore specific experimental approaches, offering you the knowledge and skills needed to advance your research.\r
