            schema1:name "Flora D'Anna" ] ;
    schema1:description """“Documentation is a love letter that you write to your future self.”\r
Damian Conway (2005)\r
\r
Make your data as useful as possible for “your future self” and others\r
Never forget what you did or how or why you did it\r
Always find beck your precious data (easily)\r
Make data understandable, reproducible and reusable by “your future self” and others\r
Avoid misinterpretation""" ;
