            schema1:name "ELIXIR Estonia" ;
            schema1:url <https://elixir.ut.ee> ] ;
    schema1:teaches """* Navigate and use the essential functions of Notion.\r
* Organise research projects using customisable workspaces and pages.\r
* Manage literature, notes, and meetings effectively within Notion.\r
* Utilise advanced features such as databases, templates, and task management tools.\r
* Collaborate with team members and share research materials seamlessly.""" ;
