- Read data with dplyr's `read_csv`
- Use dplyr and tidyverse functions to cleanup data.""" ;
    schema1:url <https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/topics/data-science/tutorials/r-dplyr/tutorial.html> ;
    schema1:version "6" .

