- Interpret quality control (QC) plots to make informed decisions on cell thresholds
- Find relevant information in GTF files for the experiment, and add this information into the metadata of the data matrix""" ;
    schema1:url <https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/topics/single-cell/tutorials/scrna-case_alevin/tutorial.html> ;
    schema1:version "25" .

