    schema1:provider [ a schema1:Organization ;
            schema1:name "GTN" ;
            schema1:url <https://training.galaxyproject.org/> ] ;
    schema1:teaches """- Write conditional statements including `if`, `elif`, and `else` branches.
- Correctly evaluate expressions containing `and` and `or`.""" ;
