- Learn how to load JBrowse data into Apollo
- Learn how to manually refine genome annotations within Apollo
- Export refined genome annotations""" ;
    schema1:url <https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/topics/genome-annotation/tutorials/apollo-euk/tutorial.html> ;
    schema1:version "16" .

