    schema1:description """## Abstract

BioBlend is a Python library to enable simple interaction with Galaxy via the command line or scripts.


## About This Material

This is a Hands-on Tutorial from the GTN which is usable either for individual self-study, or as a teaching material in a classroom.


## Questions this  will address

 - What is a REST API?
 - How to interact with Galaxy programmatically?
 - Why and when should I use BioBlend?


## Learning Objectives

- Interact with Galaxy via BioBlend.""" ;
