- Creating a Galaxy Docker flavor with the needed tools, data and workflows for a tutorial
- Testing the Galaxy Docker flavor of a tutorial""" ;
    schema1:url <https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/topics/contributing/tutorials/create-new-tutorial-technical/tutorial.html> ;
