    schema1:description """## Abstract

Galaxy is widely used for teaching. In order to facilitate instructors, the Galaxy Project has developed Training Infrastructure as a Service (TIaaS).


## About This Material

This is a Hands-on Tutorial from the GTN which is usable either for individual self-study, or as a teaching material in a classroom.


## Questions this  will address

 - How to deploy EU's TIaaS


## Learning Objectives

- Setup TIaaS
- Request and manage trainings
- Join a training""" ;
    schema1:educationalLevel "beginner" ;
    schema1:keywords "Galaxy Server administration",
        "ansible",
        "git-gat",
        "jobs",
        "training" ;
    schema1:learningResourceType "e-learning" ;
