    schema1:description """This 2-hour e-learning course presents general concepts about High Performance Computing (HPC) in life sciences to users with no or little experience.\r
\r
Topics:\r
1. Motivation: why use HPC?\r
2. General HPC concepts\r
3. Job submission - scripts\r
4. File management and storage""" ;
