    schema1:description """This tutorial helps us answer one of the most important questions not only in statistics, but all of science:  how confident are we that a result from a new drug or process is not due to random chance but due to an actual impact.

If you are familiar with sampling distributions and confidence intervals, you're ready for this adventure!""" ;
