<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/materials/integrated-design-and-analysis-of-small-population-group-trials-ideal> a schema1:LearningResource ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/TrainingMaterial/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:about <http://edamontology.org/topic_3325> ;
    schema1:description "There is a pressing need to integrate a broad range of innovative methodologies improving clinical trials in the setting of small sample population groups (SPG). The objective of IDeAl is to produce methods of general applicability irrespective of indication by Integrated DEsign and AnaLysis of clinical trials in SPG (IDeAl) through a multidisciplinary collaborating consortium of researchers from European universities, research institutes and industry." ;
