    schema1:description "Are you ready to unlock the potential of your data? This one-day workshop will introduce you to Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)—an essential first step in any data analysis workflow. Designed for graduate-level learners without a computational background, this course will equip you with the foundational skills to summarize, visualize, and interpret data effectively. With a hands-on, beginner-friendly approach, you’ll practice these skills using real-world datasets and leave with the confidence to explore data independently." ;
