    schema1:author [ a schema1:Person ;
            schema1:name "Dominic Waithe" ] ;
    schema1:contributor [ a schema1:Person ;
            schema1:name "Anatole Chessel" ],
        [ a schema1:Person ;
            schema1:name "Volker Baecker" ] ;
    schema1:description """This is an image processing practical for students with an interest in analysing biologically derived images. It is written in the language python and utilises jupyter notebook for annotation and visualisation of the code. The practical is beginner level, although some knowledge of python is recommended. In this practical students will learn to open single images as well as multi-page tiff files. Users will then learn to apply simple thresholding to an image and image-stacks and will learn to apply a variety of image filters to process the data. The practical is accompanied by lecture slides which give an introduction to image processing.\r
This training material was developed as model user case for the GBI/ELIXIR/EuBI/NEUBIAS hackathon 2018 hosted at Cambridge University.""" ;
