    schema1:description "Antimicrobial resistance (AMR) is one of the most pressing threats to global health, challenging our ability to treat infectious diseases effectively. This tutorial delves into the key concepts surrounding AMR and introduces data resources and tools to support research in this field." ;
    schema1:keywords "AMR",
        "Bacteria",
        "Pathogens",
        "Pathogens Portal" ;
