    schema1:description "Biological systems are dazzlingly complex — but mathematical modelling offers a powerful handle to explore and understand them. This tutorial empowers biologists to grasp the essential modelling concepts and engage with models that reveal the hidden logic of life, from molecules to ecosystems." ;
