    schema1:description "This webinar will focus on the use of the online molecular visualisation tool, Mol* at PDBe. We will show basic usage, observation of electron density maps and EM volumes, interrogation of ligand structures, and the visualisation of sequence annotations. We will also highlight the advantages to using Mol* in comparison to other tools and show the different ways the Mol* viewer is presented and accessed on PDBe's pages." ;
