    schema1:description """- Alexander Sczyrba (Computational Metagenomics Workgroup, Bielefeld University, Germany) introduces the topic of Genome Assembly by using Nanopore Sequencing data.\r
\r
- Maximilian Schmidt (Usadel lab, RWTH Aachen University, Germany) presents how to polish and perform assessment of Nanopore Sequencing Assemblies.\r
