    schema1:creativeWorkStatus "active" ;
    schema1:dateCreated "2024-03-05"^^schema1:Date ;
    schema1:description "This webinar reviews licensing for both software and data in bioinformatics research. We provide guidance on understanding different types of licenses, their implications, and best practices for selecting and applying them appropriately. Whether you're a researcher, bioinformatician, developer, or data steward, this webinar will equip you with the knowledge and tools necessary to navigate the complex landscape of licensing in bioinformatics effectively." ;
