    schema1:description """This video was developed in the context of the [Swiss Personalized Health Network (SPHN)](https://sphn.ch) initiative and the SPHN Interoperability framework developed by the SPHN Data Coordination Center (DCC). \r
\r
In this video you will learn how–in SPHN–semantic drifts between versions of terminologies (ATC, CHOP and ICD-10-GM) are detected to support data deliveries from university hospitals (and other data providers) and to facilitate data querying for data users.""" ;
