3. Dataset pre-assessment results: https://fairplus.github.io/fairification-results/2021-07-20-CARE-pre-assessment/ \r
4. Dataset post-assessment results: https://fairplus.github.io/fairification-results/2021-10-01-CARE-post-assessment/ \r
5. The FAIRified dataset: https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chembl/document_report_card/CHEMBL4651402/ \r
6. The success story on IMI CARE case study: https://fairplus-project.eu/case-studies/imi-care \r
7. The FAIR Wizard: https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ait/fair-wizard/\r
___________________\r
