    schema1:description """EULAR (European League Against Rheumatism) has made substantial efforts and investment in developing e-learning opportunities with the newest developments in the field of rheumatology. \r
All EULAR courses are highly subsidized and managed by a scientific course committee responsible for the structure and content of the courses and for ensuring regular quality control and advancement. Courses are available on the following topics:\r
- Rheumatic Diseases\r
- Paediatric Rheumatology\r
- Health Professionals\r
- Systemic Sclerosis\r
- Connective Tissue Diseases\r
- Online Introductory Ultrasound Course""" ;
