<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/materials/scientific-figure-design> a schema1:LearningResource ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/TrainingMaterial/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:about <http://edamontology.org/topic_0092> ;
    schema1:author [ a schema1:Person ;
            schema1:name "Simon Andrews" ],
        [ a schema1:Person ;
            schema1:name " Anne Segonds-Pichon" ],
        [ a schema1:Person ;
            schema1:name "Boo Virk" ] ;
    schema1:description """This course provides a practical guide to producing figures for use in reports and publications. It is a wide ranging course which looks at how to design figures to clearly and fairly represent your data, the practical aspects of graph creation, the allowable manipulation of bitmap images and compositing and editing of final figures.\r
\r
The course will use a number of different open source software packages and is illustrated with a number of example figures adapted from common analysis tools.\r
\r
**Course Content**\r
\r
* Data Visualisation Theory Lecture\r
* Data Representation Practical\r
* Ethics of Data Representation Lecture\r
* Design Theory Lecture\r
* GIMP Tutorial\r
* GIMP Practical\r
* Inkscape Tutorial\r
* Inkscape Practical\r
* Final Practical\r
\r
**Course Material**\r
\r
* [Figure Design Introduction (pptx)](http://www.bioinformatics.babraham.ac.uk/training/Figure_Design_Course/Figure%20design%20introduction.pptx)\r
* [Figure Design Introduction (pdf)](http://www.bioinformatics.babraham.ac.uk/training/Figure_Design_Course/Figure%20design%20introduction.pdf)\r
* [Data Visualisation Theory Lecture (pptx)](http://www.bioinformatics.babraham.ac.uk/training/Figure_Design_Course/Data%20Visualisation%20Theory%20lecture.pptx)\r
* [Data Visualisation Theory Lecture (pdf)](http://www.bioinformatics.babraham.ac.uk/training/Figure_Design_Course/Data%20Visualisation%20Theory%20lecture.pdf)\r
* [Data Representation Practical (docx)](http://www.bioinformatics.babraham.ac.uk/training/Figure_Design_Course/Data%20Representation%20Practical.docx)\r
* [Data Representation Practical (pdf)](http://www.bioinformatics.babraham.ac.uk/training/Figure_Design_Course/Data%20Representation%20Practical.pdf)\r
* [Ethics of Data Representation Lecture (pptx)](http://www.bioinformatics.babraham.ac.uk/training/Figure_Design_Course/Ethics%20of%20data%20representation.pptx)\r
* [Ethics of Data Representation Lecture (pdf)](http://www.bioinformatics.babraham.ac.uk/training/Figure_Design_Course/Ethics%20of%20data%20representation.pdf)\r
* [Design Theory Lecture (pptx)](http://www.bioinformatics.babraham.ac.uk/training/Figure_Design_Course/Design%20Theory%20Lecture.pptx)\r
* [Design Theory Lecture (pdf)](http://www.bioinformatics.babraham.ac.uk/training/Figure_Design_Course/Design%20Theory%20Lecture.pdf)\r
* [GIMP Tutorial (pptx)](http://www.bioinformatics.babraham.ac.uk/training/Figure_Design_Course/GIMP%20Tutorial.pptx)\r
* [GIMP Tutorial (pdf)](http://www.bioinformatics.babraham.ac.uk/training/Figure_Design_Course/GIMP%20Tutorial.pdf)\r
* [GIMP Practical (docx)](http://www.bioinformatics.babraham.ac.uk/training/Figure_Design_Course/GIMP%20practical.docx)\r
* [GIMP Practical (pdf)](http://www.bioinformatics.babraham.ac.uk/training/Figure_Design_Course/GIMP%20practical.pdf)\r
* [Inkscape Tutorial (pptx)](http://www.bioinformatics.babraham.ac.uk/training/Figure_Design_Course/Inkscape%20Tutorial.pptx)\r
* [Inkscape Tutorial (pdf)](http://www.bioinformatics.babraham.ac.uk/training/Figure_Design_Course/Inkscape%20Tutorial.pdf)\r
* [Inkscape Practical (docx)](http://www.bioinformatics.babraham.ac.uk/training/Figure_Design_Course/Inkscape%20practical.docx)\r
* [Inkscape Practical (pdf)](http://www.bioinformatics.babraham.ac.uk/training/Figure_Design_Course/Inkscape%20practical.pdf)\r
* [Exporting Files (docx)](http://www.bioinformatics.babraham.ac.uk/training/Figure_Design_Course/Exporting%20Files.docx)\r
* [Exporting Files (pdf)](http://www.bioinformatics.babraham.ac.uk/training/Figure_Design_Course/Exporting%20Files.pdf)\r
* [Submitting to Journals (pdf)](http://www.bioinformatics.babraham.ac.uk/training/Figure_Design_Course/Submitting%20to%20Journals.pdf)\r
* [Submitting to Journals (pptx)](http://www.bioinformatics.babraham.ac.uk/training/Figure_Design_Course/Submitting%20to%20Journals.pptx)\r
* [Final Practical (docx)](http://www.bioinformatics.babraham.ac.uk/training/Figure_Design_Course/Final%20Practical.docx)\r
* [Final Practical (pdf)](http://www.bioinformatics.babraham.ac.uk/training/Figure_Design_Course/Final%20Practical.pdf)\r
* [Figure Design Course Data (zip 15MB)](http://www.bioinformatics.babraham.ac.uk/training/Figure_Design_Course/Figure%20Design%20Course%20Data.zip)""" ;
