    schema1:description "Literature search is an essential and routine task in scientific research. Following the release of the new Europe PMC website, this webinar will show you the new full-text searching and browsing features built to optimise the literature research. Learn how to find the most recent, most relevant and most cited articles in a topic of interest. Also, learn how to find and explore the enhanced content available in Europe PMC." ;
