    schema1:description "This is a module from the \"Python for Biologists\" course. It describes how to use Python dictionary and set data structures to search your data. In particular, how to use a dictionary to represent the genetic code table and use it to translate a nucleotide sequence into a protein sequence, and how to use sets to find unique records in two datasets and remove redundancy. " ;
