    schema1:description "This set of materials includes those from the 2022 course Single-Cell RNA-seq Analysis using R; it covers the analysis of scRNA-seq data using R and command line tools. Lectures and practical sessions will cover both droplet-based and plate-based scRNA-seq analysis pipelines from raw reads to cell clusters. They will explore and interpret data using R as well as the Human Cell &amp; Single Cell Expression Atlases." ;
