    schema1:description "These materials include those from the course Single-cell RNA-seq &amp; network analysis using Galaxy and Cytoscape, which ran in April 2021. The materials utilise Galaxy pipelines, an online open-access resource that allows even the most computer-phobic bench scientists to analyse their biological data, demonstrate the droplet-based single-cell RNA-seq analysis pipelines from raw reads to cell cluster comparisons and explores single-cell networks using Cytoscape." ;
