        [ a schema1:Audience ;
            schema1:audienceType "Biologists" ] ;
    schema1:author [ a schema1:Person ;
            schema1:name "Lars Juhl Jensen" ] ;
    schema1:description """Hands-on exercises using the [STRING](https://string-db.org/), [STITCH](https://stitch-db.org/), and [DISEASES](https://diseases.jensenlab.org/) databases through their respective web interfaces. The exercises will teach you how to:\r
\r
* retrieve a STRING network for a protein of interest\r
* interpret the different visual representations\r
* inspect the evidence behind an interaction\r
* retrieve a STITCH network for chemical compound of interest\r
* use DISEASES to find proteins associated with a disease of interest""" ;
