<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/materials/summarising-data> a schema1:LearningResource ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/TrainingMaterial/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    schema1:author [ a schema1:Person ;
            schema1:name "Helen Brown" ] ;
    schema1:description """1. Introduction\r
\r
2. Introduction to Data Summary &amp; Types of data\r
\r
3. Continuous Data – Measures of Location\r
\r
4. Continuous Data – Measures of Spread &amp; Accuracy\r
\r
5. Continuous Data with Skewed or Odd Distributions – Measures of Spread\r
\r
6. Choosing Appropriate Summary Statistics for Continuous Data\r
\r
7. Measures of Accuracy for Differences in Means &amp; Medians\r
\r
8. Binary &amp; Categorical Data – Measures of Location\r
\r
9. Binary &amp; Categorical Data - Measures of Accuracy\r
\r
10. Binary &amp; Categorical Data - Presentation\r
\r
11. Ordinal Data Summary\r
\r
12. Time to Event Data\r
\r
13. Presentation of Summary Statistics\r
\r
14. Summary: Summarising One Set of Data &amp; Hypothesis Test\r
\r
15. Introduction to Hypothesis Testing\r
\r
