    schema1:description "The BioImage Archive is EMBL-EBI’s open access image archive, accepting molecular biology imaging data associated with peer-reviewed publications. This webinar will provide an introduction to the archive, including an overview of the data preparation and submission process, data retrieval, and future development plans." ;
