    schema1:description "The topic is on how you can use NeLS (nels.bioinfo.no) to store and share data, and to run analyses via customisable analysis workflows in usegalaxy.no. You will practice on transferring data between NeLS and usegalaxy.no, and to construct and run a complete sequence analysis workflow in usegalaxy.no." ;
