<https://tess.elixir-europe.org/materials/webinar-conflict-in-multi-gene-datasets-why-it-happens-and-what-to-do-about-it-deep-coalescence-paralogy-and-reticulation-d4d78ce5-83db-461e-a4c7-ad677e1df33a> a schema1:LearningResource ;
