    schema1:description """This record includes training materials associated with the Australian BioCommons webinar ‘Using in silico design methods to create de novo proteins that selectively modulate apoptosis’. This webinar took place on 16 September 2025 and is part of the series 'Leveraging deep learning to design custom protein-binding proteins'.

