    schema1:description """The [WheatIS project](http://www.wheatis.org/) aims at building an International Wheat Information System to support the wheat research community. The main objective is to provide a single-access web base system to access to the available data resources and bioinformatics tools. The project is endorsed by the [Wheat Initiative](https://www.wheatinitiative.org/).\r
The [WheatIS DataDiscovery tool](https://urgi.versailles.inrae.fr/wheatis/) allows to search data in all the wheat resources around the world.\r
\r
Here are the webinar events that described how to use the tool, what data are available, how to join, etc. \r
2020 February 25:\r
https://wheat-urgi.versailles.inrae.fr/About-us/News/WheatIS-webinar-replay\r
The replay is available on [Youtube](https://youtu.be/FoVXBhO8arY).\r
[![IMAGE ALT TEXT HERE](http://img.youtube.com/vi/FoVXBhO8arY/0.jpg)](http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FoVXBhO8arY)\r
\r
2020 October 7 in the frame of the AgBioData consortium:\r
http://wheat-urgi.versailles.inrae.fr/About-us/News/WheatIS-DataDiscovery-webinar-replay\r
The replay is available on [Youtube](https://youtu.be/pSST0jepoRgY).""" ;
