    schema1:description """"Ready For BioData Management?" is BioData.pt/ELIXIR-Portugal's capacity building program in data management for the life sciences.\r
Under this program, we have organized an intro-level workshop on data management plans, the material for which is available.\r
We are also organizing an advanced course and course modules.""" ;
